<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DRV_YELLOW_WARNING_LAMP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yellow warning lamp: ON!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gelbe Warnlampe: EIN!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Keltainen varoitusvalo: PÄÄLLÄ!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lampe d'avertissement jaune: ALLUMÉE!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sárga figyelmeztető lámpa: BE!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gele waarschuwingslamp: AAN!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gul varningslampa: PÅ!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Жовта попереджувальна лампа: УВІМК!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DRV_YELLOW_WARNING_LAMP_OFF</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yellow warning lamp: Off</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gelbe Warnlampe: Aus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Keltainen varoitusvalo: Pois</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lampe d'avertissement jaune: Éteinte</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sárga figyelmeztető lámpa: Ki</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gele waarschuwingslamp: Uit</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gul varningslampa: Av</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Жовта попереджувальна лампа: Вимк</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DRV_YES</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ja</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kyllä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Oui</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Igen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ja</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ja</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Так</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_12V_LOW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12V battery source below required voltage to safely close contactors. Inspect the supply/battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12V-Batteriequelle unter der erforderlichen Spannung zum sicheren Schließen der Schütze. Versorgung/Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12V-akun jännite alle vaaditun tason kontaktorien turvalliseen sulkemiseen. Tarkista syöttö/akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Source batterie 12V sous la tension requise pour fermer les contacteurs en toute sécurité. Inspectez l'alimentation/la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A 12V-os tápforrás a mágneskapcsolók biztonságos zárásához szükséges feszültség alatt van. Ellenőrizze a tápellátást/akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12V-voeding onder de vereiste spanning om contactoren veilig te sluiten. Controleer de voeding/batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12V-batterikälla under nödvändig spänning för att säkert sluta kontaktorerna. Inspektera matningen/batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Напруга джерела 12V нижча за необхідну для безпечного замикання контакторів. Перевірте живлення/батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_AUTOMATIC_PRECHARGE_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatic precharge FAILURE. Failed to reach target voltage or BMS timeout. Reboot emulator to retry!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatische Vorladung FEHLGESCHLAGEN. Zielspannung nicht erreicht oder BMS-Timeout. Emulator neu starten, um es erneut zu versuchen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automaattinen esilataus EPÄONNISTUI. Tavoitejännitettä ei saavutettu tai BMS-aikakatkaisu. Käynnistä emulaattori uudelleen yrittääksesi uudestaan!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ÉCHEC de la précharge automatique. Tension cible non atteinte ou timeout BMS. Redémarrez l'émulateur pour réessayer!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatikus előtöltés HIBA. Nem sikerült elérni a célfeszültséget, vagy BMS időtúllépés. Indítsa újra az emulátort az újrapróbálkozáshoz!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatische voorlading MISLUKT. Doelspanning niet bereikt of BMS-time-out. Herstart de emulator om opnieuw te proberen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatisk förladdning MISSLYCKADES. Nådde inte målspänningen eller BMS-timeout. Starta om emulatorn för att försöka igen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ЗБІЙ автоматичного попереднього заряджання. Не досягнуто цільової напруги або тайм-аут BMS. Перезавантажте емулятор для повторної спроби!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BALANCING_END</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing has ended</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing wurde beendet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansointi on päättynyt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'équilibrage est terminé</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A kiegyenlítés befejeződött</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balanceren is beëindigd</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansering har avslutats</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Балансування завершено</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BALANCING_START</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing has started</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing wurde gestartet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansointi on alkanut</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'équilibrage a commencé</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A kiegyenlítés elkezdődött</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balanceren is gestart</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansering har startat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Балансування розпочато</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_CAUTION</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery has raised a general caution flag. Might want to inspect it closely.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat eine allgemeine Warnmeldung gesetzt. Ggf. genauer prüfen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku on nostanut yleisen varoituslipun. Se kannattaa ehkä tarkistaa huolellisesti.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie a levé un drapeau d'avertissement général. Une inspection approfondie peut être utile.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor általános figyelmeztető jelzést adott. Érdemes lehet alaposan átvizsgálni.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij heeft een algemene waarschuwingsvlag gezet. Nadere inspectie aanbevolen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet har höjt en allmän varningsflagga. Kan vara värt att inspektera det noggrant.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея підняла загальний прапорець застереження. Варто уважно її оглянути.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_CHG_DISCHG_STOP_REQ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery raised caution indicator AND requested charge/discharge stop. Inspect battery status!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat Warnindikator gesetzt UND Lade-/Entladestopp angefordert. Batteriestatus prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku nosti varoitusindikaattorin JA pyysi latauksen/purun pysäytystä. Tarkista akun tila!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie a levé un indicateur d'avertissement ET demandé l'arrêt de la charge/décharge. Inspectez l'état de la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor figyelmeztető jelzést adott, ÉS a töltés/kisütés leállítását kérte. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátor állapotát!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij gaf waarschuwing EN verzocht stop van laden/ontladen. Controleer batterijstatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet höjde varningsindikator OCH begärde stopp av laddning/urladdning. Inspektera batteristatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея підняла індикатор застереження ТА запросила зупинку заряду/розряду. Перевірте стан батареї!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_CHG_STOP_REQ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery raised caution indicator AND requested charge stop. Inspect battery status!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat Warnindikator gesetzt UND Ladestopp angefordert. Batteriestatus prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku nosti varoitusindikaattorin JA pyysi latauksen pysäytystä. Tarkista akun tila!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie a levé un indicateur d'avertissement ET demandé l'arrêt de la charge. Inspectez l'état de la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor figyelmeztető jelzést adott, ÉS a töltés leállítását kérte. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátor állapotát!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij gaf waarschuwing EN verzocht laadstop. Controleer batterijstatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet höjde varningsindikator OCH begärde laddstopp. Inspektera batteristatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея підняла індикатор застереження ТА запросила зупинку заряду. Перевірте стан батареї!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_DISCHG_STOP_REQ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery raised caution indicator AND requested discharge stop. Inspect battery status!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat Warnindikator gesetzt UND Entladestopp angefordert. Batteriestatus prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku nosti varoitusindikaattorin JA pyysi purun pysäytystä. Tarkista akun tila!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie a levé un indicateur d'avertissement ET demandé l'arrêt de la décharge. Inspectez l'état de la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor figyelmeztető jelzést adott, ÉS a kisütés leállítását kérte. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátor állapotát!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij gaf waarschuwing EN verzocht ontlaadstop. Controleer batterijstatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet höjde varningsindikator OCH begärde urladdningsstopp. Inspektera batteristatus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея підняла індикатор застереження ТА запросила зупинку розряду. Перевірте стан батареї!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_EMPTY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery is completely discharged</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie ist vollständig entladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku on täysin purkautunut</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie est complètement déchargée</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor teljesen lemerült</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij is volledig ontladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet är helt urladdat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея повністю розряджена</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_FROZEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery is too cold to operate optimally. Consider warming it up!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie ist zu kalt für optimalen Betrieb. Aufwärmen in Betracht ziehen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku on liian kylmä toimiakseen optimaalisesti. Harkitse sen lämmittämistä!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie est trop froide pour fonctionner de manière optimale. Pensez à la réchauffer!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor túl hideg az optimális működéshez. Érdemes felmelegíteni!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij is te koud voor optimale werking. Overweeg de batterij op te warmen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet är för kallt för optimal drift. Överväg att värma upp det!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея занадто холодна для оптимальної роботи. Варто її прогріти!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_FULL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery is fully charged</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie ist vollständig geladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku on täyteen ladattu</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie est complètement chargée</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor teljesen fel van töltve</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij is volledig opgeladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet är fulladdat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея повністю заряджена</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_FUSE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery internal fuse blown. Inspect battery</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Interne Batteriesicherung durchgebrannt. Batterie prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun sisäinen sulake palanut. Tarkista akku</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fusible interne de la batterie grillé. Inspectez la batterie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor belső biztosítéka kiolvadt. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Interne zekering van batterij doorgebrand. Controleer batterij</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriets interna säkring har löst ut. Inspektera batteriet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Перегорів внутрішній запобіжник батареї. Огляньте батарею</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_ISOLATION</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery reports isolation error. High voltage might be leaking to ground. Check battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie meldet Isolationsfehler. Hochspannung könnte gegen Masse abfließen. Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku ilmoittaa eristysviasta. Korkeajännite voi vuotaa maahan. Tarkista akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie signale une erreur d'isolement. La haute tension pourrait fuir vers la masse. Vérifiez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor szigetelési hibát jelez. Nagyfeszültség szivároghat a földre. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij meldt isolatiefout. Hoogspanning lekt mogelijk naar aarde. Controleer batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet rapporterar isolationsfel. Högspänning kan läcka till jord. Kontrollera batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея повідомляє про помилку ізоляції. Висока напруга може витікати на землю. Перевірте батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_OVERHEAT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery overheated. Shutting down to prevent thermal runaway!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie überhitzt. Abschaltung zur Vermeidung eines thermischen Durchgehens!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku ylikuumentunut. Sammutetaan lämpökarkaamisen estämiseksi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie en surchauffe. Arrêt pour éviter l'emballement thermique!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor túlmelegedett. Leállítás a hőmegfutás megelőzésére!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij oververhit. Uitschakelen om thermal runaway te voorkomen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet överhettat. Stänger av för att förhindra termisk rusning!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея перегрілася. Вимкнення для запобігання тепловому розгону!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_OVERVOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery exceeding maximum design voltage. Discharge battery to prevent damage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie überschreitet maximale Auslegungsspannung. Batterie entladen, um Schäden zu vermeiden!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku ylittää suurimman suunnittelujännitteen. Pura akkua vaurioiden estämiseksi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie dépasse la tension maximale de conception. Déchargez la batterie pour éviter des dommages!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor túllépi a maximális tervezési feszültséget. Süsse ki az akkumulátort a károsodás megelőzésére!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij overschrijdt maximale ontwerpspanning. Ontlaad de batterij om schade te voorkomen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet överskrider maximal designspänning. Ladda ur batteriet för att förhindra skada!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея перевищує максимальну проєктну напругу. Розрядіть батарею, щоб запобігти пошкодженню!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_REQUESTS_HEAT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>COLD BATTERY! Battery requesting heating pads to activate!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KALTE BATTERIE! Batterie fordert Aktivierung der Heizmatten an!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KYLMÄ AKKU! Akku pyytää lämmitystyynyjen aktivointia!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BATTERIE FROIDE! La batterie demande l'activation des coussins chauffants!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HIDEG AKKUMULÁTOR! Az akkumulátor a fűtőbetétek aktiválását kéri!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KOUDE BATTERIJ! Batterij verzoekt activering van verwarmingselementen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KALLT BATTERI! Batteriet begär att värmedynor aktiveras!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ХОЛОДНА БАТАРЕЯ! Батарея запитує ввімкнення нагрівальних елементів!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_SOC_RECALIBRATION</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The BMS updated the HV battery State of Charge (SOC) by more than 3pct based on SocByOcv.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das BMS hat den SOC der HV-Batterie basierend auf SocByOcv um mehr als 3 % aktualisiert.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS päivitti HV-akun varaustilan (SOC) yli 3 % SocByOcv:n perusteella.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le BMS a mis à jour l'état de charge (SOC) de la batterie HV de plus de 3pct d'après SocByOcv.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS több mint 3%-kal frissítette a HV akkumulátor töltöttségi szintjét (SOC) a SocByOcv alapján.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De BMS heeft de laadtoestand (SOC) van de HV-batterij met meer dan 3pct bijgewerkt op basis van SocByOcv.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS uppdaterade HV-batteriets laddningstillstånd (SOC) med mer än 3 % baserat på SocByOcv.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS оновив рівень заряду (SOC) HV-батареї більш ніж на 3 % на основі SocByOcv.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_SOC_RESET_FAIL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC reset routine failed - check SOC is &lt; 15 or &gt; 90, and contactors are open.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-Reset-Routine fehlgeschlagen - prüfen, ob SOC &lt; 15 oder &gt; 90 ist und Schütze offen sind.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-nollausrutiini epäonnistui - tarkista, että SOC on &lt; 15 tai &gt; 90 ja että kontaktorit ovat auki.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de la routine de réinitialisation du SOC - vérifiez que le SOC est &lt; 15 ou &gt; 90 et que les contacteurs sont ouverts.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A SOC visszaállítási rutin sikertelen – ellenőrizze, hogy a SOC &lt; 15 vagy &gt; 90, és a mágneskapcsolók nyitva vannak.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-resetroutine mislukt - controleer of SOC &lt; 15 of &gt; 90 is en of de contactoren open zijn.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-återställningsrutin misslyckades - kontrollera att SOC är &lt; 15 eller &gt; 90 och att kontaktorerna är öppna.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Процедура скидання SOC не вдалася - перевірте, що SOC &lt; 15 або &gt; 90 і контактори розімкнені.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_SOC_RESET_SUCCESS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC reset routine was successful.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-Reset-Routine war erfolgreich.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-nollausrutiini onnistui.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La routine de réinitialisation du SOC a réussi.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A SOC visszaállítási rutin sikeres volt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-resetroutine was succesvol.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-återställningsrutinen lyckades.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Процедуру скидання SOC успішно виконано.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_UNDERVOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery under minimum design voltage. Charge battery to prevent damage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie unter minimaler Auslegungsspannung. Batterie laden, um Schäden zu vermeiden!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku alle pienimmän suunnittelujännitteen. Lataa akku vaurioiden estämiseksi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie sous la tension minimale de conception. Chargez la batterie pour éviter des dommages!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor a minimális tervezési feszültség alatt van. Töltse fel az akkumulátort a károsodás megelőzésére!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij onder minimale ontwerpspanning. Laad de batterij om schade te voorkomen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet under minsta designspänning. Ladda batteriet för att förhindra skada!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея нижче мінімальної проєктної напруги. Зарядіть батарею, щоб запобігти пошкодженню!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_VALUE_UNAVAILABLE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery measurement unavailable. Check 12V power supply and battery wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriemesswert nicht verfügbar. 12V-Versorgung und Batterieverkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun mittaus ei saatavilla. Tarkista 12V-virtalähde ja akun johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mesure de la batterie indisponible. Vérifiez l'alimentation 12V et le câblage de la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátormérés nem elérhető. Ellenőrizze a 12V-os tápellátást és az akkumulátor kábelezését!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterijmeting niet beschikbaar. Controleer 12V-voeding en batterijbedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterimätning otillgänglig. Kontrollera 12V-matning och batterikablage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Вимірювання батареї недоступне. Перевірте живлення 12V та проводку батареї!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BATTERY_WARMED_UP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery requesting heating pads to stop. The battery is now warm enough.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie fordert Abschaltung der Heizmatten an. Die Batterie ist jetzt warm genug.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku pyytää lämmitystyynyjen sammuttamista. Akku on nyt riittävän lämmin.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie demande l'arrêt des coussins chauffants. La batterie est maintenant assez chaude.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor a fűtőbetétek leállítását kéri. Az akkumulátor már elég meleg.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij verzoekt verwarmingselementen te stoppen. De batterij is nu warm genoeg.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet begär att värmedynorna stängs av. Batteriet är nu tillräckligt varmt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея запитує вимкнення нагрівальних елементів. Батарея вже достатньо тепла.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BMS_RESET_REQ_FAIL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS reset request failed - check contactors are open.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-Reset-Anforderung fehlgeschlagen - prüfen, ob Schütze offen sind.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-nollauspyyntö epäonnistui - tarkista, että kontaktorit ovat auki.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de la demande de réinitialisation du BMS - vérifiez que les contacteurs sont ouverts.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS visszaállítási kérés sikertelen – ellenőrizze, hogy a mágneskapcsolók nyitva vannak.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-resetverzoek mislukt - controleer of de contactoren open zijn.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-återställningsbegäran misslyckades - kontrollera att kontaktorerna är öppna.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Запит скидання BMS не вдався - перевірте, що контактори розімкнені.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BMS_RESET_REQ_SUCCESS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS reset request completed successfully.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-Reset-Anforderung erfolgreich abgeschlossen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-nollauspyyntö suoritettu onnistuneesti.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Demande de réinitialisation du BMS terminée avec succès.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS visszaállítási kérés sikeresen befejeződött.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-resetverzoek succesvol voltooid.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-återställningsbegäran slutförd.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Запит скидання BMS успішно виконано.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BYD_AUTO_SOC_CALIBRATION</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Auto SOC recalibration to 100% triggered. Data column shows drift% below 100%.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatische SOC-Rekalibrierung auf 100% ausgelöst. Datenspalte zeigt Drift% unter 100%.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automaattinen SOC:n uudelleenkalibrointi 100 %:iin käynnistetty. Data-sarake näyttää poikkeama-% alle 100 %.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Recalibration automatique du SOC à 100% déclenchée. La colonne Data indique le % de dérive sous 100%.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatikus SOC újrakalibrálás 100%-ra elindítva. Az adatoszlop a 100% alatti eltolódás%-ot mutatja.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatische SOC-herkalibratie naar 100% geactiveerd. Datakolom toont drift% onder 100%.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Automatisk SOC-omkalibrering till 100 % utlöst. Datakolumnen visar drift% under 100 %.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Автоматичне перекалібрування SOC до 100 % запущено. Стовпець даних показує дрейф% нижче 100 %.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BYD_CONTACTOR_CLOSE_REQ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactor close commanded. The battery precharges and closes its contactors. Data: 1 = cancelled a pending open.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schließen der Schütze befohlen. Die Batterie lädt vor und schließt ihre Schütze. Daten: 1 = ausstehendes Öffnen abgebrochen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorien sulkeminen komennettu. Akku esilataa ja sulkee kontaktorinsa. Data: 1 = peruutti odottavan avauksen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fermeture des contacteurs commandée. La batterie effectue la précharge et ferme ses contacteurs. Données: 1 = ouverture en attente annulée.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsoló zárása parancsolva. Az akkumulátor előtölt és zárja a mágneskapcsolóit. Adat: 1 = függőben lévő nyitás megszakítva.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactor sluiten gecommandeerd. De batterij laadt voor en sluit haar contactoren. Data: 1 = openstaand openen geannuleerd.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorslutning kommenderad. Batteriet förladdas och sluter sina kontaktorer. Data: 1 = avbröt en väntande öppning.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Надано команду замкнути контактори. Батарея виконує попередній заряд і замикає контактори. Дані: 1 = скасовано відкладене розмикання.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BYD_CONTACTOR_FORCE_OPEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactors force-opened: pack current was not confirmed safe before the timeout. Data: 0 = current stayed high, 1 = no fresh current reading. Check the inverter ramped down.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schütze zwangsgeöffnet: Packstrom wurde vor dem Timeout nicht als sicher bestätigt. Daten: 0 = Strom blieb hoch, 1 = keine aktuelle Strommessung. Prüfen, ob der Wechselrichter heruntergeregelt hat.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorit pakkoavattu: akuston virtaa ei vahvistettu turvalliseksi ennen aikakatkaisua. Data: 0 = virta pysyi korkeana, 1 = ei tuoretta virtalukemaa. Tarkista, että invertteri laski tehonsa.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contacteurs ouverts de force: le courant du pack n'a pas été confirmé sûr avant le délai. Données: 0 = courant resté élevé, 1 = pas de mesure de courant récente. Vérifier que l'onduleur a réduit sa puissance.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsolók kényszernyitva: a pakk árama nem lett biztonságosnak megerősítve az időkorlát előtt. Adat: 0 = az áram magas maradt, 1 = nincs friss árammérés. Ellenőrizze, hogy az inverter leszabályozott-e.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactoren geforceerd geopend: pakstroom niet veilig bevestigd vóór de time-out. Data: 0 = stroom bleef hoog, 1 = geen recente stroommeting. Controleer of de omvormer is afgeregeld.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorer tvångsöppnade: packströmmen bekräftades inte säker före timeouten. Data: 0 = strömmen förblev hög, 1 = ingen färsk strömavläsning. Kontrollera att växelriktaren rampade ner.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Контактори примусово розімкнено: струм батареї не підтверджено безпечним до тайм-ауту. Дані: 0 = струм залишався високим, 1 = немає свіжого показу струму. Перевірте, що інвертор знизив потужність.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BYD_CONTACTOR_MISMATCH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery did not confirm the contactor command in time. Data: 2 = open not confirmed, 3 = close not confirmed.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat den Schützbefehl nicht rechtzeitig bestätigt. Daten: 2 = Öffnen nicht bestätigt, 3 = Schließen nicht bestätigt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku ei vahvistanut kontaktorikomentoa ajoissa. Data: 2 = avaus vahvistamatta, 3 = sulkeminen vahvistamatta.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie n'a pas confirmé la commande du contacteur à temps. Données: 2 = ouverture non confirmée, 3 = fermeture non confirmée.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor nem erősítette meg időben a mágneskapcsoló parancsot. Adat: 2 = nyitás nincs megerősítve, 3 = zárás nincs megerősítve.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij heeft het contactorcommando niet op tijd bevestigd. Data: 2 = openen niet bevestigd, 3 = sluiten niet bevestigd.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet bekräftade inte kontaktorkommandot i tid. Data: 2 = öppning ej bekräftad, 3 = slutning ej bekräftad.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея не підтвердила команду контакторів вчасно. Дані: 2 = розмикання не підтверджено, 3 = замикання не підтверджено.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_BYD_CONTACTOR_OPEN_REQ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactor open commanded. Power is set to zero and the contactors open once current stops. Data: 1 = from an emergency stop saved across reboot.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Öffnen der Schütze befohlen. Leistung wird auf null gesetzt und die Schütze öffnen, sobald der Strom stoppt. Daten: 1 = durch einen über den Neustart gespeicherten Not-Aus.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorien avaus komennettu. Teho asetetaan nollaan ja kontaktorit avautuvat, kun virta lakkaa. Data: 1 = uudelleenkäynnistyksen yli tallennetusta hätäpysäytyksestä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ouverture des contacteurs commandée. La puissance est mise à zéro et les contacteurs s'ouvrent dès l'arrêt du courant. Données: 1 = arrêt d'urgence conservé après redémarrage.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsoló nyitása parancsolva. A teljesítmény nullára áll, és a mágneskapcsolók nyitnak, amint az áram megszűnik. Adat: 1 = újraindítás után is megőrzött vészleállításból.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactor openen gecommandeerd. Vermogen wordt op nul gezet en de contactoren openen zodra de stroom stopt. Data: 1 = van een noodstop bewaard over herstart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktoröppning kommenderad. Effekten sätts till noll och kontaktorerna öppnar när strömmen upphör. Data: 1 = från ett nödstopp sparat över omstart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Надано команду розімкнути контактори. Потужність встановлюється в нуль, і контактори розмикаються після зникнення струму. Дані: 1 = від аварійної зупинки, збереженої після перезавантаження.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CANMCP2515_INIT_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-MCP addon initialization failed. Check hardware</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Initialisierung des CAN-MCP-Addons fehlgeschlagen. Hardware prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-MCP-lisäosan alustus epäonnistui. Tarkista laitteisto</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de l'initialisation du module additionnel CAN-MCP. Vérifiez le matériel</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CAN-MCP bővítmény inicializálása sikertelen. Ellenőrizze a hardvert</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Initialisatie CAN-MCP-addon mislukt. Controleer hardware</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Initialisering av CAN-MCP-tillägg misslyckades. Kontrollera hårdvaran</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося ініціалізувати модуль CAN-MCP. Перевірте обладнання</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CANMCP2518FD_INIT_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-FD initialization failed. Check hardware or bitrate settings</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-FD-Initialisierung fehlgeschlagen. Hardware oder Bitrateneinstellungen prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-FD-alustus epäonnistui. Tarkista laitteisto tai bittinopeusasetukset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de l'initialisation CAN-FD. Vérifiez le matériel ou les paramètres de débit</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CAN-FD inicializálása sikertelen. Ellenőrizze a hardvert vagy a bitráta-beállításokat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-FD-initialisatie mislukt. Controleer hardware of bitrate-instellingen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-FD-initialisering misslyckades. Kontrollera hårdvara eller bithastighetsinställningar</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося ініціалізувати CAN-FD. Перевірте обладнання або налаштування бітрейту</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY2_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with secondary battery. Secondary battery detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit Sekundärbatterie erfolgreich. Sekundärbatterie erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys toiseen akkuun toimii. Toinen akku havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec la batterie secondaire. Batterie secondaire détectée!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció a második akkumulátorral. Második akkumulátor észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met tweede batterij succesvol. Tweede batterij gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med sekundärt batteri. Sekundärt batteri detekterat!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок із другою батареєю. Другу батарею виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY2_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Secondary battery not sending messages via CAN for the last 60 seconds. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sekundärbatterie hat in den letzten 60 Sekunden keine CAN-Nachrichten gesendet. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Toinen akku ei ole lähettänyt viestejä CAN-väylällä viimeisten 60 sekunnin aikana. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie secondaire n'a envoyé aucun message via CAN depuis 60 secondes. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A második akkumulátor 60 másodperce nem küld CAN-üzeneteket. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tweede batterij zond de laatste 60 seconden geen berichten via CAN. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sekundärt batteri har inte skickat meddelanden via CAN de senaste 60 sekunderna. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Друга батарея не надсилає повідомлення через CAN протягом останніх 60 секунд. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY3_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with third battery. Third battery detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit dritter Batterie erfolgreich. Dritte Batterie erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys kolmanteen akkuun toimii. Kolmas akku havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec la troisième batterie. Troisième batterie détectée!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció a harmadik akkumulátorral. Harmadik akkumulátor észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met derde batterij succesvol. Derde batterij gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med tredje batteriet. Tredje batteriet detekterat!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок із третьою батареєю. Третю батарею виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY3_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Third battery not sending messages via CAN for the last 60 seconds. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dritte Batterie hat in den letzten 60 Sekunden keine CAN-Nachrichten gesendet. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kolmas akku ei ole lähettänyt viestejä CAN-väylällä viimeisten 60 sekunnin aikana. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La troisième batterie n'a envoyé aucun message via CAN depuis 60 secondes. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A harmadik akkumulátor 60 másodperce nem küld CAN-üzeneteket. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Derde batterij zond de laatste 60 seconden geen berichten via CAN. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tredje batteriet har inte skickat meddelanden via CAN de senaste 60 sekunderna. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Третя батарея не надсилає повідомлення через CAN протягом останніх 60 секунд. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with battery. Battery detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit Batterie erfolgreich. Batterie erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys akkuun toimii. Akku havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec la batterie. Batterie détectée!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció az akkumulátorral. Akkumulátor észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met batterij succesvol. Batterij gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med batteriet. Batteri detekterat!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок із батареєю. Батарею виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_BATTERY_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery not sending messages via CAN for the last 60 seconds. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat in den letzten 60 Sekunden keine CAN-Nachrichten gesendet. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku ei ole lähettänyt viestejä CAN-väylällä viimeisten 60 sekunnin aikana. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie n'a envoyé aucun message via CAN depuis 60 secondes. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor 60 másodperce nem küld CAN-üzeneteket. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij zond de laatste 60 seconden geen berichten via CAN. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet har inte skickat meddelanden via CAN de senaste 60 sekunderna. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея не надсилає повідомлення через CAN протягом останніх 60 секунд. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_CHARGER_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with charger. Charger detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit Ladegerät erfolgreich. Ladegerät erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys laturiin toimii. Laturi havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec le chargeur. Chargeur détecté!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció a töltővel. Töltő észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met lader succesvol. Lader gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med laddaren. Laddare detekterad!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок із зарядним пристроєм. Зарядний пристрій виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_CHARGER_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Charger not sending messages via CAN for the last 60 seconds. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ladegerät hat in den letzten 60 Sekunden keine CAN-Nachrichten gesendet. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laturi ei ole lähettänyt viestejä CAN-väylällä viimeisten 60 sekunnin aikana. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le chargeur n'a envoyé aucun message via CAN depuis 60 secondes. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A töltő 60 másodperce nem küld CAN-üzeneteket. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lader zond de laatste 60 seconden geen berichten via CAN. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laddaren har inte skickat meddelanden via CAN de senaste 60 sekunderna. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Зарядний пристрій не надсилає повідомлення через CAN протягом останніх 60 секунд. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_CORRUPTED_WARNING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>High amount of corrupted CAN messages detected. Check CAN wire shielding!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hohe Anzahl beschädigter CAN-Nachrichten erkannt. Abschirmung der CAN-Leitung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suuri määrä vioittuneita CAN-viestejä havaittu. Tarkista CAN-kaapelin suojaus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Grand nombre de messages CAN corrompus détectés. Vérifiez le blindage des fils CAN!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nagy mennyiségű sérült CAN-üzenet észlelve. Ellenőrizze a CAN-vezetékek árnyékolását!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Veel beschadigde CAN-berichten gedetecteerd. Controleer afscherming van CAN-bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stort antal korrupta CAN-meddelanden detekterade. Kontrollera CAN-kabelns skärmning!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Виявлено велику кількість пошкоджених повідомлень CAN. Перевірте екранування проводів CAN!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_INVERTER_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with inverter. Inverter detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit Wechselrichter erfolgreich. Wechselrichter erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys invertteriin toimii. Invertteri havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec l'onduleur. Onduleur détecté!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció az inverterrel. Inverter észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met omvormer succesvol. Omvormer gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med växelriktaren. Växelriktare detekterad!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок з інвертором. Інвертор виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_INVERTER_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter not sending messages via CAN for the last 60 seconds. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichter hat in den letzten 60 Sekunden keine CAN-Nachrichten gesendet. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri ei ole lähettänyt viestejä CAN-väylällä viimeisten 60 sekunnin aikana. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur n'a envoyé aucun message via CAN depuis 60 secondes. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter 60 másodperce nem küld CAN-üzeneteket. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormer zond de laatste 60 seconden geen berichten via CAN. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktaren har inte skickat meddelanden via CAN de senaste 60 sekunderna. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор не надсилає повідомлення через CAN протягом останніх 60 секунд. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_NATIVE_BUFFER_FULL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN failed to send. Buffer full or no one on the bus to ACK the message!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-Senden fehlgeschlagen. Puffer voll oder niemand am Bus, der die Nachricht bestätigt (ACK)!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-lähetys epäonnistui. Puskuri täynnä tai kukaan väylällä ei kuittaa (ACK) viestiä!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec d'envoi CAN. Tampon plein ou personne sur le bus pour acquitter (ACK) le message!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CAN-küldés sikertelen. A puffer megtelt, vagy nincs senki a buszon, aki nyugtázná az üzenetet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-verzending mislukt. Buffer vol of niemand op de bus om het bericht te ACK-en!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN kunde inte skicka. Bufferten full eller ingen på bussen som ACK:ar meddelandet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося надіслати CAN. Буфер переповнено або на шині нікому підтвердити (ACK) повідомлення!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CAN_NATIVE_BUS_ERROR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Multiple CAN TX/RX errors. Check wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mehrere CAN-TX/RX-Fehler. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Useita CAN TX/RX-virheitä. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Multiples erreurs CAN TX/RX. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Több CAN TX/RX hiba. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Meerdere CAN TX/RX-fouten. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Flera CAN TX/RX-fel. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Численні помилки CAN TX/RX. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CELL_CRITICAL_OVER_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELL VOLTAGE CRITICALLY HIGH! Not possible to continue. Inspect battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ZELLSPANNUNG KRITISCH HOCH! Fortsetzung nicht möglich. Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KENNOJÄNNITE KRIITTISEN KORKEA! Jatkaminen ei ole mahdollista. Tarkista akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TENSION DE CELLULE CRITIQUEMENT ÉLEVÉE! Impossible de continuer. Inspectez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CELLAFESZÜLTSÉG KRITIKUSAN MAGAS! A folytatás nem lehetséges. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELSPANNING KRITIEK HOOG! Doorgaan niet mogelijk. Controleer batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELLSPÄNNING KRITISKT HÖG! Inte möjligt att fortsätta. Inspektera batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>НАПРУГА КОМІРКИ КРИТИЧНО ВИСОКА! Продовження неможливе. Огляньте батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CELL_CRITICAL_UNDER_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELL VOLTAGE CRITICALLY LOW! Not possible to continue. Inspect battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ZELLSPANNUNG KRITISCH NIEDRIG! Fortsetzung nicht möglich. Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KENNOJÄNNITE KRIITTISEN MATALA! Jatkaminen ei ole mahdollista. Tarkista akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TENSION DE CELLULE CRITIQUEMENT BASSE! Impossible de continuer. Inspectez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CELLAFESZÜLTSÉG KRITIKUSAN ALACSONY! A folytatás nem lehetséges. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELSPANNING KRITIEK LAAG! Doorgaan niet mogelijk. Controleer batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CELLSPÄNNING KRITISKT LÅG! Inte möjligt att fortsätta. Inspektera batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>НАПРУГА КОМІРКИ КРИТИЧНО НИЗЬКА! Продовження неможливе. Огляньте батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CELL_DEVIATION_HIGH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Large cell voltage deviation! Check balancing of cells</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Große Zellspannungsabweichung! Balancing der Zellen prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suuri kennojännitteiden poikkeama! Tarkista kennojen balansointi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Grand écart de tension entre cellules! Vérifiez l'équilibrage des cellules</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nagy cellafeszültség-eltérés! Ellenőrizze a cellák kiegyenlítését</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Grote afwijking in celspanning! Controleer balancering van cellen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stor cellspänningsavvikelse! Kontrollera cellernas balansering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Велике відхилення напруги комірок! Перевірте балансування комірок</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CELL_OVER_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cell overvoltage. Further charging not possible. Check balancing of cells</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zellüberspannung. Weiteres Laden nicht möglich. Balancing der Zellen prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kennon ylijännite. Lataaminen ei ole enää mahdollista. Tarkista kennojen balansointi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Surtension de cellule. Charge supplémentaire impossible. Vérifiez l'équilibrage des cellules</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cella-túlfeszültség. További töltés nem lehetséges. Ellenőrizze a cellák kiegyenlítését</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cel-overspanning. Verder laden niet mogelijk. Controleer balancering van cellen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cellöverspänning. Ytterligare laddning inte möjlig. Kontrollera cellernas balansering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Перенапруга комірки. Подальше заряджання неможливе. Перевірте балансування комірок</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CELL_UNDER_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cell undervoltage. Further discharge not possible. Check balancing of cells</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zellunterspannung. Weiteres Entladen nicht möglich. Balancing der Zellen prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kennon alijännite. Purkaminen ei ole enää mahdollista. Tarkista kennojen balansointi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sous-tension de cellule. Décharge supplémentaire impossible. Vérifiez l'équilibrage des cellules</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cella-alulfeszültség. További kisütés nem lehetséges. Ellenőrizze a cellák kiegyenlítését</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cel-onderspanning. Verder ontladen niet mogelijk. Controleer balancering van cellen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cellunderspänning. Ytterligare urladdning inte möjlig. Kontrollera cellernas balansering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Понижена напруга комірки. Подальший розряд неможливий. Перевірте балансування комірок</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CHARGE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter is charging faster than battery is allowing.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichter lädt schneller, als die Batterie zulässt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri lataa nopeammin kuin akku sallii.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur charge plus vite que ce que la batterie autorise.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter gyorsabban tölt, mint amit az akkumulátor engedélyez.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormer laadt sneller dan de batterij toestaat.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktaren laddar snabbare än batteriet tillåter.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор заряджає швидше, ніж дозволяє батарея.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CONTACTOR_OPEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery decided to open contactors. Inspect battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie hat entschieden, die Schütze zu öffnen. Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku päätti avata kontaktorit. Tarkista akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La batterie a décidé d'ouvrir les contacteurs. Inspectez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor a mágneskapcsolók nyitása mellett döntött. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij besloot contactoren te openen. Controleer batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet beslutade att öppna kontaktorerna. Inspektera batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея вирішила розімкнути контактори. Огляньте батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_CONTACTOR_WELDED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactors sticking/welded. Inspect battery with caution!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schütze kleben/verschweißt. Batterie mit Vorsicht prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorit jumissa/hitsautuneet. Tarkista akku varoen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contacteurs collés/soudés. Inspectez la batterie avec prudence!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A mágneskapcsolók ragadnak/összehegedtek. Óvatosan vizsgálja át az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactoren klevend/vastgelast. Controleer batterij met voorzichtigheid!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontaktorer kärvar/svetsade. Inspektera batteriet med försiktighet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Контактори залипли/зварилися. Оглядайте батарею з обережністю!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_DISCHARGE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter is discharging faster than battery is allowing.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichter entlädt schneller, als die Batterie zulässt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri purkaa nopeammin kuin akku sallii.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur décharge plus vite que ce que la batterie autorise.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter gyorsabban süt ki, mint amit az akkumulátor engedélyez.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormer ontlaadt sneller dan de batterij toestaat.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktaren laddar ur snabbare än batteriet tillåter.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор розряджає швидше, ніж дозволяє батарея.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_DUMMY_DEBUG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The dummy debug event was set!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Dummy-Debug-Ereignis wurde gesetzt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-debug-tapahtuma asetettiin!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'événement de débogage factice a été déclenché!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A dummy debug esemény beállítva!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De dummy-debuggebeurtenis werd gezet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-debughändelsen sattes!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тестову подію debug встановлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_DUMMY_ERROR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The dummy error event was set!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Dummy-Fehler-Ereignis wurde gesetzt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-virhetapahtuma asetettiin!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'événement d'erreur factice a été déclenché!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A dummy hiba esemény beállítva!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De dummy-foutgebeurtenis werd gezet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-felhändelsen sattes!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тестову подію помилки встановлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_DUMMY_INFO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The dummy info event was set!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Dummy-Info-Ereignis wurde gesetzt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-info-tapahtuma asetettiin!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'événement d'information factice a été déclenché!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A dummy info esemény beállítva!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De dummy-infogebeurtenis werd gezet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-infohändelsen sattes!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тестову інформаційну подію встановлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_DUMMY_WARNING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The dummy warning event was set!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Dummy-Warn-Ereignis wurde gesetzt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-varoitustapahtuma asetettiin!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'événement d'avertissement factice a été déclenché!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A dummy figyelmeztetés esemény beállítva!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De dummy-waarschuwingsgebeurtenis werd gezet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dummy-varningshändelsen sattes!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тестову подію попередження встановлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_EQUIPMENT_STOP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>User requested stop, either via equipment stop circuit or webserver Open Contactor button</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Benutzer hat Stopp angefordert, entweder über den Equipment-Stop-Kreis oder die Schaltfläche „Schütze öffnen“ im Webserver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Käyttäjä pyysi pysäytystä joko laitteiston pysäytyspiirin tai web-palvelimen Avaa kontaktorit -painikkeen kautta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Arrêt demandé par l'utilisateur, via le circuit d'arrêt d'équipement ou le bouton Ouvrir les contacteurs du serveur web</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A felhasználó leállítást kért, vagy a vészleállító áramkörön, vagy a webszerver Mágneskapcsolók nyitása gombján keresztül</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gebruiker verzocht stop, via equipment-stopcircuit of de knop Contactoren openen in de webserver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Användaren begärde stopp, antingen via utrustningsstoppkretsen eller webbserverns knapp Öppna kontaktorer</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Користувач запросив зупинку через контур аварійної зупинки обладнання або кнопку розмикання контакторів на вебсервері</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_ERROR_OPEN_CONTACTOR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Too much time spent in error state. Opening contactors, not safe to continue. Check other active ERROR code for reason. Reboot emulator after problem is solved!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zu viel Zeit im Fehlerzustand verbracht. Schütze werden geöffnet, Fortsetzung nicht sicher. Ursache im anderen aktiven ERROR-Code prüfen. Emulator nach Behebung des Problems neu starten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Liian pitkä aika virhetilassa. Avataan kontaktorit, jatkaminen ei ole turvallista. Katso syy muista aktiivisista ERROR-koodeista. Käynnistä emulaattori uudelleen, kun ongelma on ratkaistu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Trop de temps passé en état d'erreur. Ouverture des contacteurs, poursuite non sûre. Vérifier l'autre code ERROR actif pour la raison. Redémarrer l'émulateur une fois le problème résolu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Túl sok idő telt el hibaállapotban. Mágneskapcsolók nyitása, a folytatás nem biztonságos. Az okot a másik aktív ERROR kód mutatja. A probléma megoldása után indítsa újra az emulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Te veel tijd in fouttoestand doorgebracht. Contactoren worden geopend, doorgaan is niet veilig. Controleer de andere actieve ERROR-code voor de reden. Herstart de emulator nadat het probleem is opgelost!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>För lång tid i feltillstånd. Öppnar kontaktorer, inte säkert att fortsätta. Kontrollera annan aktiv FEL-kod för orsaken. Starta om emulatorn efter att problemet är löst!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Занадто довге перебування в стані помилки. Розмикання контакторів, продовження небезпечне. Перевірте інший активний код ERROR, щоб з'ясувати причину. Перезавантажте емулятор після вирішення проблеми!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_GPIO_CONFLICT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO Pin Conflict: The pin used by '{0}' is already allocated by '{1}'. Please check your configuration and assign different pins.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO-Pin-Konflikt: Der von '{0}' genutzte Pin ist bereits durch '{1}' belegt. Bitte Konfiguration prüfen und andere Pins zuweisen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO-pinniristiriita: Pinni, jota käyttää '{0}', on jo varattu '{1}':lle. Tarkista kokoonpano ja määritä eri pinnit.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Conflit de broche GPIO: la broche utilisée par '{0}' est déjà allouée par '{1}'. Vérifier la configuration et assigner des broches différentes.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO láb ütközés: a(z) '{0}' által használt lábat már a(z) '{1}' foglalja. Ellenőrizze a konfigurációt, és rendeljen hozzá másik lábakat.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO-pinconflict: de pin gebruikt door '{0}' is al toegewezen aan '{1}'. Controleer de configuratie en wijs andere pinnen toe.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GPIO-pinnkonflikt: Pinnen som används av '{0}' är redan tilldelad '{1}'. Kontrollera din konfiguration och tilldela andra pinnar.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Конфлікт піна GPIO: Пін, що використовується '{0}', вже виділено для '{1}'. Перевірте конфігурацію та призначте інші піни.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_GPIO_NOT_DEFINED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Missing GPIO Assignment: The component '{0}' requires a GPIO pin that isn't configured. Please define a valid pin number in your settings.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehlende GPIO-Zuweisung: Die Komponente '{0}' benötigt einen GPIO-Pin, der nicht konfiguriert ist. Bitte eine gültige Pin-Nummer in den Einstellungen festlegen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puuttuva GPIO-määritys: Komponentti '{0}' tarvitsee GPIO-pinnin, jota ei ole määritetty. Määritä kelvollinen pinninumero asetuksissa.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Affectation GPIO manquante: le composant '{0}' nécessite une broche GPIO non configurée. Définir un numéro de broche valide dans les paramètres.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiányzó GPIO hozzárendelés: a(z) '{0}' komponensnek olyan GPIO lábra van szüksége, amely nincs konfigurálva. Adjon meg érvényes lábszámot a beállításokban.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ontbrekende GPIO-toewijzing: de component '{0}' vereist een GPIO-pin die niet is geconfigureerd. Definieer een geldig pinnummer in de instellingen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saknad GPIO-tilldelning: Komponenten '{0}' kräver en GPIO-pinne som inte är konfigurerad. Ange ett giltigt pinnummer i dina inställningar.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Відсутнє призначення GPIO: Компонент '{0}' потребує пін GPIO, який не налаштовано. Вкажіть дійсний номер піна в налаштуваннях.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_HVIL_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery interlock loop broken. Check that high voltage / low voltage connectors are seated. Battery will be disabled!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie-Interlock-Schleife unterbrochen. Prüfen, ob Hochvolt-/Niedervolt-Stecker richtig sitzen. Batterie wird deaktiviert!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun turvalukituspiiri katkennut. Tarkista, että korkea- ja pienjänniteliittimet ovat kunnolla paikoillaan. Akku poistetaan käytöstä!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Boucle d'interverrouillage de la batterie rompue. Vérifier que les connecteurs haute/basse tension sont bien en place. La batterie sera désactivée!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor reteszelő hurka megszakadt. Ellenőrizze, hogy a nagyfeszültségű / kisfeszültségű csatlakozók megfelelően illeszkednek-e. Az akkumulátor letiltásra kerül!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Interlock-lus van de batterij verbroken. Controleer of de hoogspannings-/laagspanningsconnectoren goed vastzitten. Batterij wordt uitgeschakeld!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriets förreglingsslinga bruten. Kontrollera att högspännings-/lågspänningskontakterna sitter ordentligt. Batteriet kommer att inaktiveras!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Розірвано контур блокування батареї (HVIL). Перевірте, що роз'єми високої/низької напруги вставлені до кінця. Батарею буде вимкнено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_INTERFACE_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Configuration trying to use CAN interface not baked into the software. Recompile software!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Konfiguration versucht, eine CAN-Schnittstelle zu verwenden, die nicht in die Software integriert ist. Software neu kompilieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kokoonpano yrittää käyttää CAN-liitäntää, jota ei ole käännetty ohjelmistoon. Käännä ohjelmisto uudelleen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La configuration tente d'utiliser une interface CAN non intégrée au logiciel. Recompilez le logiciel!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A konfiguráció olyan CAN-interfészt próbál használni, amely nincs beépítve a szoftverbe. Fordítsa újra a szoftvert!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Configuratie probeert een CAN-interface te gebruiken die niet in de software is meegecompileerd. Hercompileer de software!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Konfigurationen försöker använda ett CAN-gränssnitt som inte är inbyggt i mjukvaran. Kompilera om mjukvaran!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Конфігурація намагається використати інтерфейс CAN, не вбудований у програму. Перекомпілюйте програму!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_INTERNAL_OPEN_FAULT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>High voltage cable removed while battery running. Opening contactors!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hochvoltkabel bei laufender Batterie entfernt. Schütze werden geöffnet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Korkeajännitekaapeli irrotettu akun ollessa käynnissä. Avataan kontaktorit!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Câble haute tension retiré pendant le fonctionnement de la batterie. Ouverture des contacteurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A nagyfeszültségű kábelt működés közben eltávolították. Mágneskapcsolók nyitása!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoogspanningskabel verwijderd terwijl batterij actief was. Contactoren worden geopend!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Högspänningskabel borttagen medan batteriet är i drift. Öppnar kontaktorer!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Кабель високої напруги від'єднано під час роботи батареї. Розмикання контакторів!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_INVERTER_OPEN_CONTACTOR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter side opened contactors. Normal operation.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichterseite hat Schütze geöffnet. Normaler Betrieb.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteripuoli avasi kontaktorit. Normaali toiminta.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le côté onduleur a ouvert les contacteurs. Fonctionnement normal.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter oldala nyitotta a mágneskapcsolókat. Normál működés.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormerzijde opende contactoren. Normale werking.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktarsidan öppnade kontaktorerna. Normal drift.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Контактори розімкнено з боку інвертора. Нормальна робота.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_KWH_PLAUSIBILITY_ERROR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>kWh remaining reported by battery not plausible. Battery needs cycling.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Von der Batterie gemeldete verbleibende kWh nicht plausibel. Batterie muss zyklisiert werden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun ilmoittama jäljellä oleva kWh ei ole uskottava. Akku vaatii syklauksen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>kWh restants signalés par la batterie non plausibles. La batterie doit être cyclée.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor által jelentett hátralévő kWh nem plauzibilis. Az akkumulátort ciklizálni kell.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Resterende kWh gemeld door batterij niet plausibel. Batterij moet gecycled worden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Återstående kWh rapporterat av batteriet är inte rimligt. Batteriet behöver cyklas.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Залишок kWh, повідомлений батареєю, неправдоподібний. Батарея потребує циклування.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_LOW_HEAP_MEMORY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Memory almost full. Inform developers.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Speicher fast voll. Entwickler informieren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Muisti lähes täynnä. Ilmoita kehittäjille.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mémoire presque pleine. Informez les développeurs.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A memória majdnem megtelt. Értesítse a fejlesztőket.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Geheugen bijna vol. Informeer ontwikkelaars.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minnet nästan fullt. Informera utvecklarna.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Пам'ять майже заповнена. Повідомте розробників.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_MODBUS_INVERTER_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Successfully communicating with inverter over Modbus/RS485. Inverter detected!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunikation mit Wechselrichter über Modbus/RS485 erfolgreich. Wechselrichter erkannt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys invertteriin Modbus/RS485:n kautta toimii. Invertteri havaittu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communication établie avec l'onduleur via Modbus/RS485. Onduleur détecté!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sikeres kommunikáció az inverterrel Modbus/RS485-ön keresztül. Inverter észlelve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Communicatie met omvormer via Modbus/RS485 succesvol. Omvormer gedetecteerd!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommunicerar med växelriktaren via Modbus/RS485. Växelriktare detekterad!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішний зв'язок з інвертором через Modbus/RS485. Інвертор виявлено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_MODBUS_INVERTER_MISSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus inverter has not sent any data. Inspect communication wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus-Wechselrichter hat keine Daten gesendet. Kommunikationsverkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus-invertteri ei ole lähettänyt dataa. Tarkista tiedonsiirtojohdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur Modbus n'a envoyé aucune donnée. Inspectez le câblage de communication!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A Modbus inverter nem küldött adatot. Ellenőrizze a kommunikációs kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus-omvormer heeft geen data verzonden. Controleer communicatiebedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus-växelriktaren har inte skickat några data. Inspektera kommunikationskablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Modbus-інвертор не надіслав жодних даних. Перевірте комунікаційну проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_MQTT_CONNECT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT connected.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT verbunden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT yhdistetty.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT connecté.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT csatlakozva.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT verbonden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT ansluten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT підключено.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_MQTT_DISCONNECT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT disconnected.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT getrennt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-yhteys katkaistu.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT déconnecté.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT kapcsolat bontva.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-verbinding verbroken.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT frånkopplad.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT відключено.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_NO_ENABLE_DETECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter Enable line has not been active for a long time. Check Wiring!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable-Leitung des Wechselrichters war lange nicht aktiv. Verkabelung prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertterin Enable-linja ei ole ollut aktiivinen pitkään aikaan. Tarkista johdotus!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La ligne Enable de l'onduleur est inactive depuis longtemps. Vérifiez le câblage!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter Enable vonala hosszú ideje nem aktív. Ellenőrizze a kábelezést!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable-lijn van omvormer is lange tijd niet actief geweest. Controleer bedrading!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktarens Enable-ledning har inte varit aktiv på länge. Kontrollera kablaget!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Лінія Enable інвертора давно не була активною. Перевірте проводку!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_OTA_UPDATE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA update started!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-Update gestartet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-päivitys aloitettu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mise à jour OTA démarrée!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA frissítés elindult!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-update gestart!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-uppdatering startad!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Оновлення OTA розпочато!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_OTA_UPDATE_TIMEOUT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA update timed out!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-Update: Zeitüberschreitung!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-päivitys aikakatkaistiin!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La mise à jour OTA a expiré!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA frissítés időtúllépés!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Time-out bij OTA-update!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>OTA-uppdatering fick timeout!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тайм-аут оновлення OTA!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PAUSE_BEGIN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The emulator is trying to pause the battery.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der Emulator versucht, die Batterie zu pausieren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulaattori yrittää keskeyttää akun toiminnan.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'émulateur tente de mettre la batterie en pause.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az emulátor megpróbálja szüneteltetni az akkumulátort.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De emulator probeert de batterij te pauzeren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulatorn försöker pausa batteriet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Емулятор намагається призупинити батарею.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PAUSE_END</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The emulator is attempting to resume battery operation from pause.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der Emulator versucht, den Batteriebetrieb aus der Pause fortzusetzen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulaattori yrittää jatkaa akun toimintaa tauolta.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'émulateur tente de reprendre le fonctionnement de la batterie après la pause.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az emulátor megpróbálja folytatni az akkumulátor működését a szünet után.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De emulator probeert de batterijwerking te hervatten na pauze.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulatorn försöker återuppta batteridriften från paus.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Емулятор намагається відновити роботу батареї після паузи.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PERIODIC_BMS_RESET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS reset event completed.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-Reset-Ereignis abgeschlossen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-nollaustapahtuma valmis.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Événement de réinitialisation du BMS terminé.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS visszaállítási esemény befejeződött.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-resetgebeurtenis voltooid.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-återställningshändelse slutförd.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Подію скидання BMS завершено.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PERIODIC_BMS_RESET_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS reset aborted - contactors were still under load.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-Reset abgebrochen - Schütze standen noch unter Last.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-nollaus keskeytetty - kontaktorit olivat yhä kuormitettuina.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réinitialisation du BMS annulée - les contacteurs étaient encore sous charge.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS visszaállítása megszakítva – a mágneskapcsolók még terhelés alatt voltak.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-reset afgebroken - contactoren stonden nog onder belasting.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-återställning avbruten - kontaktorerna var fortfarande belastade.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скидання BMS перервано - контактори все ще були під навантаженням.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PERSISTENT_SAVE_INFO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Failed to save user settings. Namespace full?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Speichern der Benutzereinstellungen fehlgeschlagen. Namespace voll?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Käyttäjäasetusten tallennus epäonnistui. Nimiavaruus täynnä?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de l'enregistrement des paramètres utilisateur. Espace de noms plein?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A felhasználói beállítások mentése sikertelen. Megtelt a névtér?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Opslaan van gebruikersinstellingen mislukt. Namespace vol?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kunde inte spara användarinställningar. Namnrymd full?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося зберегти налаштування користувача. Простір імен заповнено?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PID_FAILED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Failed to write PID request to battery</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schreiben der PID-Anforderung an die Batterie fehlgeschlagen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>PID-pyynnön kirjoitus akulle epäonnistui</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de l'écriture de la requête PID vers la batterie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A PID-kérés írása az akkumulátorba sikertelen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schrijven van PID-verzoek naar batterij mislukt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kunde inte skriva PID-begäran till batteriet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося записати PID-запит до батареї</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_PRECHARGE_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery failed to precharge. Check that capacitor is seated on high voltage output.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vorladung der Batterie fehlgeschlagen. Prüfen, ob der Kondensator am Hochvoltausgang angeschlossen ist.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun esilataus epäonnistui. Tarkista, että kondensaattori on paikallaan korkeajännitelähdössä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de la précharge de la batterie. Vérifiez que le condensateur est en place sur la sortie haute tension.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor előtöltése sikertelen. Ellenőrizze, hogy a kondenzátor csatlakozik a nagyfeszültségű kimenetre.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voorlading van batterij mislukt. Controleer of de condensator op de hoogspanningsuitgang is aangesloten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet misslyckades med förladdning. Kontrollera att kondensatorn sitter på högspänningsutgången.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося виконати попередній заряд батареї. Перевірте, що конденсатор встановлений на виході високої напруги.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RECOVERY_END</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emergency charge recovery max time reached. Reboot and inspect if battery is able to continue normally</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale Zeit der Notladungswiederherstellung erreicht. Neu starten und prüfen, ob die Batterie normal weiterarbeiten kann</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hätälatauksen palautuksen enimmäisaika saavutettu. Käynnistä uudelleen ja tarkista, voiko akku jatkaa normaalisti</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Durée max de récupération de charge d'urgence atteinte. Redémarrez et vérifiez si la batterie peut continuer normalement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A vészhelyzeti töltés-helyreállítás elérte a maximális időt. Indítsa újra, és ellenőrizze, hogy az akkumulátor képes-e normálisan folytatni</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale tijd noodlaadherstel bereikt. Herstart en controleer of de batterij normaal kan doorgaan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maxtid för nödladdningsåterställning uppnådd. Starta om och kontrollera om batteriet kan fortsätta normalt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Досягнуто макс. часу аварійного відновного заряджання. Перезавантажте та перевірте, чи батарея може працювати нормально</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RECOVERY_START</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAUTION! Emergency low charge recovery started! Make sure battery cells do not overheat!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ACHTUNG! Notfall-Wiederherstellung bei niedriger Ladung gestartet! Sicherstellen, dass die Batteriezellen nicht überhitzen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HUOMIO! Hätäelvytys matalasta varauksesta aloitettu! Varmista, etteivät akkukennot ylikuumene!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ATTENTION! Récupération d'urgence de charge basse démarrée! Assurez-vous que les cellules de la batterie ne surchauffent pas!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>FIGYELEM! Vészhelyzeti helyreállítás alacsony töltöttségről elindult! Ügyeljen rá, hogy az akkumulátorcellák ne melegedjenek túl!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>LET OP! Noodherstel bij lage lading gestart! Zorg dat batterijcellen niet oververhitten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>VARNING! Nödåterställning av låg laddning har startat! Se till att battericellerna inte överhettas!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>УВАГА! Розпочато аварійне відновлення низького заряду! Переконайтеся, що елементи батареї не перегріваються!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_BROWNOUT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to a momentary low voltage condition. This is expected during certain operations like flashing via USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines kurzzeitigen Spannungseinbruchs zurückgesetzt. Dies ist bei bestimmten Vorgängen wie dem Flashen über USB zu erwarten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin hetkellisen alijännitteen vuoksi. Tämä on odotettua tietyissä toiminnoissa, kuten USB-flashauksessa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a été réinitialisée à cause d'une chute de tension momentanée. C'est attendu lors de certaines opérations comme le flashage par USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A kártya újraindult egy pillanatnyi feszültségesés miatt. Ez bizonyos műveleteknél, például USB-n keresztüli flashelésnél várható</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het board is gereset door een kortstondige onderspanning. Dit is te verwachten bij bepaalde handelingen zoals flashen via USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av ett tillfälligt lågspänningstillstånd. Detta är förväntat under vissa operationer som flashning via USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через короткочасне зниження напруги. Це очікувано під час певних операцій, як-от прошивання через USB</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_CPU_LOCKUP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to CPU lockup. Inform developers!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen CPU-Lockup zurückgesetzt. Entwickler informieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin CPU:n lukkiutumisen vuoksi. Ilmoita kehittäjille!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à un blocage du CPU. Informez les développeurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel CPU-lefagyás miatt újraindult. Értesítse a fejlesztőket!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door CPU-lockup. Informeer ontwikkelaars!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av CPU-låsning. Informera utvecklarna!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через зависання CPU. Повідомте розробників!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_DEEPSLEEP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset after exiting deep sleep mode</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde nach Verlassen des Deep-Sleep-Modus zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin syväunitilasta poistumisen jälkeen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré après la sortie du mode sommeil profond</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel a mély alvó módból való kilépés után újraindult</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset na het verlaten van de diepe slaapmodus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes efter att ha lämnat djupsömnläge</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто після виходу з режиму глибокого сну</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_EFUSE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to an efuse error</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines eFuse-Fehlers zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin efuse-virheen vuoksi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à une erreur efuse</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel efuse-hiba miatt újraindult</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een efuse-fout</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av ett efuse-fel</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через помилку efuse</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_EXT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset from an external pin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde über einen externen Pin zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin ulkoisesta nastasta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a été réinitialisée depuis une broche externe</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel külső lábról lett újraindítva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset via een externe pin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes från ett externt stift</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через зовнішній вивід</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_INT_WDT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to an interrupt watchdog timeout. Inform developers!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines Interrupt-Watchdog-Timeouts zurückgesetzt. Entwickler informieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin keskeytysvahtikoiran aikakatkaisun vuoksi. Ilmoita kehittäjille!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à un timeout du watchdog d'interruption. Informez les développeurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel megszakítás-watchdog időtúllépés miatt újraindult. Értesítse a fejlesztőket!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een interrupt-watchdog-time-out. Informeer ontwikkelaars!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av timeout i avbrotts-watchdog. Informera utvecklarna!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через тайм-аут сторожового таймера переривань. Повідомте розробників!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset by JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde per JTAG zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin JTAG:n kautta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a été réinitialisée par JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panelt JTAG indította újra</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes av JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через JTAG</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_PANIC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to an exception or panic. Inform developers!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen einer Exception oder Panic zurückgesetzt. Entwickler informieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin poikkeuksen tai paniikin vuoksi. Ilmoita kehittäjille!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à une exception ou une panique. Informez les développeurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel kivétel vagy pánik miatt újraindult. Értesítse a fejlesztőket!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een exception of panic. Informeer ontwikkelaars!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av ett undantag eller panik. Informera utvecklarna!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через виняток або паніку. Повідомте розробників!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_POWERON</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset from a power-on event. Normal operation</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde durch Einschalten zurückgesetzt. Normaler Betrieb</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin käynnistystapahtumasta. Normaali toiminta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à une mise sous tension. Fonctionnement normal</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel bekapcsolási esemény után indult el. Normál működés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een inschakelgebeurtenis. Normale werking</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes från en påslagningshändelse. Normal drift</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через подію ввімкнення живлення. Нормальна робота</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_PWR_GLITCH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to a detected power glitch</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines erkannten Spannungsglitches zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin havaitun virtapiikin vuoksi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à un glitch d'alimentation détecté</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel észlelt tápellátási zavar miatt újraindult</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een gedetecteerde voedingsglitch</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av en detekterad spänningsstörning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через виявлений збій живлення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset over SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde über SDIO zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin SDIO:n kautta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a été réinitialisée via SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel SDIO-n keresztül lett újraindítva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset via SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes via SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через SDIO</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_SW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset via software, webserver or OTA. Normal operation</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde per Software, Webserver oder OTA zurückgesetzt. Normaler Betrieb</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin ohjelmiston, verkkopalvelimen tai OTA:n kautta. Normaali toiminta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré via logiciel, serveur web ou OTA. Fonctionnement normal</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel szoftveresen, webszerverről vagy OTA útján lett újraindítva. Normál működés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset via software, webserver of OTA. Normale werking</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes via mjukvara, webbserver eller OTA. Normal drift</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через програмне забезпечення, вебсервер або OTA. Нормальна робота</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_TASK_WDT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to a task watchdog timeout. Inform developers!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines Task-Watchdog-Timeouts zurückgesetzt. Entwickler informieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin tehtävävahtikoiran aikakatkaisun vuoksi. Ilmoita kehittäjille!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à un timeout du watchdog de tâche. Informez les développeurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel task-watchdog időtúllépés miatt újraindult. Értesítse a fejlesztőket!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een taak-watchdog-time-out. Informeer ontwikkelaars!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av timeout i task-watchdog. Informera utvecklarna!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через тайм-аут сторожового таймера задач. Повідомте розробників!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_UNKNOWN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset unexpectedly, and reason can't be determined</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde unerwartet zurückgesetzt, die Ursache kann nicht ermittelt werden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin odottamatta, eikä syytä voida määrittää</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré de façon inattendue, la raison ne peut pas être déterminée</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel váratlanul újraindult, és az ok nem állapítható meg</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is onverwacht gereset en de reden kan niet worden bepaald</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes oväntat och orsaken kan inte fastställas</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто несподівано, і причину неможливо визначити</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset by the USB peripheral</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde durch die USB-Peripherie zurückgesetzt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin USB-oheislaitteen toimesta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a été réinitialisée par le périphérique USB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panelt az USB-periféria indította újra</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door het USB-randapparaat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes av USB-enheten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто периферійним пристроєм USB</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESET_WDT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The board was reset due to other watchdog timeout. Inform developers!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Das Board wurde wegen eines anderen Watchdog-Timeouts zurückgesetzt. Entwickler informieren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortti nollattiin muun vahtikoiran aikakatkaisun vuoksi. Ilmoita kehittäjille!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La carte a redémarré suite à un autre timeout de watchdog. Informez les développeurs!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A panel egyéb watchdog-időtúllépés miatt újraindult. Értesítse a fejlesztőket!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het bord is gereset door een andere watchdog-time-out. Informeer ontwikkelaars!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kortet återställdes på grund av annan watchdog-timeout. Informera utvecklarna!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Плату було скинуто через тайм-аут іншого сторожового таймера. Повідомте розробників!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RESTARTING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The emulator is restarting.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der Emulator startet neu.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulaattori käynnistyy uudelleen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'émulateur redémarre.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az emulátor újraindul.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De emulator herstart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulatorn startar om.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Емулятор перезапускається.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_RJXZS_LOG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error code active in RJXZS BMS. Clear via their smartphone app!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehlercode im RJXZS-BMS aktiv. Über deren Smartphone-App löschen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhekoodi aktiivinen RJXZS BMS:ssä. Kuittaa heidän älypuhelinsovelluksellaan!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Code d'erreur actif dans le BMS RJXZS. Effacez-le via leur application smartphone!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktív hibakód a RJXZS BMS-ben. Törölje a gyártó okostelefonos alkalmazásával!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Foutcode actief in RJXZS BMS. Wis deze via hun smartphone-app!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Felkod aktiv i RJXZS BMS. Rensa via deras smartphone-app!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Активний код помилки в RJXZS BMS. Скиньте через їхній застосунок для смартфона!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SD_INIT_FAILED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SD card initialization failed, check hardware. Power must be removed to reset the SD card.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SD-Karten-Initialisierung fehlgeschlagen, Hardware prüfen. Zum Zurücksetzen der SD-Karte muss die Stromversorgung getrennt werden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SD-kortin alustus epäonnistui, tarkista laitteisto. Virta on katkaistava SD-kortin nollaamiseksi.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de l'initialisation de la carte SD, vérifiez le matériel. L'alimentation doit être coupée pour réinitialiser la carte SD.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az SD-kártya inicializálása sikertelen, ellenőrizze a hardvert. Az SD-kártya visszaállításához a tápellátást meg kell szüntetni.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Initialisatie SD-kaart mislukt, controleer hardware. Voeding moet worden losgekoppeld om de SD-kaart te resetten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Initiering av SD-kort misslyckades, kontrollera hårdvaran. Strömmen måste kopplas bort för att återställa SD-kortet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося ініціалізувати SD-карту, перевірте обладнання. Для скидання SD-карти потрібно вимкнути живлення.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SERIAL_RX_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error in serial function: No data for a long time!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler in serieller Funktion: Lange keine Daten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe sarjaliikennetoiminnossa: Ei dataa pitkään aikaan!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur dans la fonction série: aucune donnée depuis longtemps!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba a soros funkcióban: hosszú ideje nincs adat!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout in seriële functie: lange tijd geen data!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel i seriell funktion: Ingen data på länge!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка послідовного інтерфейсу: Немає даних протягом тривалого часу!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SERIAL_RX_WARNING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error in serial function: No data received for some time, see data for minutes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler in serieller Funktion: Seit einiger Zeit keine Daten empfangen, Minuten siehe Datenwert</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe sarjaliikennetoiminnossa: Dataa ei ole vastaanotettu vähään aikaan, katso minuutit datasta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur dans la fonction série: aucune donnée reçue depuis un certain temps, voir les données pour les minutes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba a soros funkcióban: egy ideje nem érkezett adat, a percek számát lásd az adatoknál</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout in seriële functie: enige tijd geen data ontvangen, zie data voor minuten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel i seriell funktion: Ingen data mottagen på en tid, se data för minuter</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка послідовного інтерфейсу: Дані не надходили деякий час, кількість хвилин див. у даних</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SERIAL_TRANSMITTER_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error in serial function: Some ERROR level fault in transmitter, received by receiver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler in serieller Funktion: ERROR-Level-Fehler im Sender, vom Empfänger empfangen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe sarjaliikennetoiminnossa: ERROR-tason vika lähettimessä, vastaanottimen havaitsema</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur dans la fonction série: défaut de niveau ERROR dans l'émetteur, reçu par le récepteur</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba a soros funkcióban: ERROR szintű hiba az adóban, amelyet a vevő fogadott</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout in seriële functie: fout op ERROR-niveau in zender, ontvangen door ontvanger</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel i seriell funktion: Något fel på ERROR-nivå i sändaren, mottaget av mottagaren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка послідовного інтерфейсу: Несправність рівня ERROR у передавачі, отримана приймачем</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SERIAL_TX_FAILURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error in serial function: No ACK from receiver!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler in serieller Funktion: Kein ACK vom Empfänger!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe sarjaliikennetoiminnossa: Ei ACK-kuittausta vastaanottimelta!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur dans la fonction série: pas d'ACK du récepteur!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba a soros funkcióban: nincs ACK a vevőtől!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout in seriële functie: geen ACK van ontvanger!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel i seriell funktion: Ingen ACK från mottagaren!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка послідовного інтерфейсу: Немає ACK від приймача!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SMA_PAIRING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SMA inverter trying to pair, contactors will close and open according to Enable line</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SMA-Wechselrichter versucht Kopplung, Schütze schließen und öffnen gemäß Enable-Leitung</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SMA-invertteri yrittää muodostaa laiteparia, kontaktorit sulkeutuvat ja avautuvat Enable-linjan mukaan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur SMA tente de s'appairer, les contacteurs se fermeront et s'ouvriront selon la ligne Enable</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az SMA inverter párosítást kísérel meg, a mágneskapcsolók az Enable vonal szerint zárnak és nyitnak</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SMA-omvormer probeert te koppelen, contactoren sluiten en openen volgens de Enable-lijn</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SMA-växelriktare försöker parkoppla, kontaktorerna stängs och öppnas enligt Enable-linjen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор SMA намагається виконати сполучення, контактори замикатимуться та розмикатимуться відповідно до лінії Enable</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SOC_PLAUSIBILITY_ERROR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC reported by battery not plausible. Restart battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Von der Batterie gemeldeter SOC nicht plausibel. Batterie neu starten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun ilmoittama SOC ei ole uskottava. Käynnistä akku uudelleen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC signalé par la batterie non plausible. Redémarrez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátor által jelentett SOC nem plauzibilis. Indítsa újra az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC gemeld door batterij niet plausibel. Herstart de batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC rapporterad av batteriet är inte rimlig. Starta om batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC, повідомлений батареєю, неправдоподібний. Перезапустіть батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SOC_UNAVAILABLE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC not sent by BMS. Calibrate BMS via app.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC wird vom BMS nicht gesendet. BMS über App kalibrieren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS ei lähetä SOC-arvoa. Kalibroi BMS sovelluksella.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC non envoyé par le BMS. Calibrez le BMS via l'application.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A BMS nem küld SOC-ot. Kalibrálja a BMS-t az alkalmazáson keresztül.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC niet verzonden door BMS. Kalibreer BMS via app.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC skickas inte av BMS. Kalibrera BMS via appen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS не надсилає SOC. Відкалібруйте BMS через застосунок.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SOH_DIFFERENCE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Large deviation in State of health between packs. Inspect battery.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Große Abweichung des Gesundheitszustands zwischen den Packs. Batterie prüfen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suuri poikkeama pakettien kuntotilassa (SOH). Tarkasta akku.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Grand écart d'état de santé entre les packs. Inspectez la batterie.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nagy eltérés a pakkok egészségi állapota között. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Grote afwijking in gezondheidstoestand tussen pakketten. Controleer batterij.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stor avvikelse i hälsotillstånd (SOH) mellan packen. Inspektera batteriet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Велике відхилення стану справності (SOH) між пакетами. Огляньте батарею.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_SOH_LOW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>State of health critically low. Battery internal resistance too high to continue. Recycle battery.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gesundheitszustand kritisch niedrig. Innenwiderstand der Batterie zu hoch, um fortzufahren. Batterie recyceln.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kuntotila kriittisen alhainen. Akun sisäinen resistanssi liian korkea jatkamiseen. Kierrätä akku.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>État de santé critique. Résistance interne de la batterie trop élevée pour continuer. Recycler la batterie.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az egészségi állapot kritikusan alacsony. Az akkumulátor belső ellenállása túl magas a folytatáshoz. Hasznosítsa újra az akkumulátort.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gezondheidstoestand kritiek laag. Interne weerstand van de batterij te hoog om door te gaan. Recycle de batterij.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hälsotillståndet är kritiskt lågt. Batteriets inre resistans är för hög för att fortsätta. Återvinn batteriet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Стан справності критично низький. Внутрішній опір батареї занадто високий для продовження. Утилізуйте батарею.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_STALE_VALUE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Important values detected as stale. System might have locked up!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wichtige Werte als veraltet erkannt. System könnte eingefroren sein!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tärkeitä arvoja havaittu vanhentuneiksi. Järjestelmä on voinut lukkiutua!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valeurs importantes détectées comme périmées. Le système s'est peut-être bloqué!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fontos értékek elavultként lettek észlelve. A rendszer lefagyhatott!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Belangrijke waarden gedetecteerd als verouderd. Systeem is mogelijk vastgelopen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Viktiga värden har detekterats som inaktuella. Systemet kan ha låst sig!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Важливі значення визначено як застарілі. Система могла зависнути!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_TASK_OVERRUN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Task took too long to complete. CPU load might be too high. Info message, no action required.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Task hat zu lange gedauert. CPU-Last möglicherweise zu hoch. Infomeldung, keine Aktion erforderlich.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tehtävän suoritus kesti liian kauan. CPU-kuorma voi olla liian korkea. Infoviesti, ei toimenpiteitä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La tâche a mis trop de temps à se terminer. La charge CPU est peut-être trop élevée. Message d'information, aucune action requise.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A feladat túl sokáig futott. A CPU-terhelés túl magas lehet. Tájékoztató üzenet, nincs teendő.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Taak duurde te lang. CPU-belasting mogelijk te hoog. Infomelding, geen actie vereist.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>En uppgift tog för lång tid att slutföra. CPU-belastningen kan vara för hög. Informationsmeddelande, ingen åtgärd krävs.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Виконання задачі тривало занадто довго. Навантаження на CPU може бути завеликим. Інформаційне повідомлення, дій не потрібно.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_THERMAL_RUNAWAY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>THERMAL RUNAWAY! POTENTIAL FIRE OR EXPLOSION IMMINENT!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>THERMISCHES DURCHGEHEN! BRAND- ODER EXPLOSIONSGEFAHR UNMITTELBAR BEVORSTEHEND!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>LÄMPÖRYNTÄYS! MAHDOLLINEN TULIPALO TAI RÄJÄHDYS UHKAA VÄLITTÖMÄSTI!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EMBALLEMENT THERMIQUE! INCENDIE OU EXPLOSION POTENTIELLEMENT IMMINENT!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HŐMEGFUTÁS! TŰZ- VAGY ROBBANÁSVESZÉLY FENYEGET!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>THERMAL RUNAWAY! MOGELIJK BRAND OF EXPLOSIE OPHANDEN!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TERMISK RUSNING! POTENTIELL BRAND ELLER EXPLOSION NÄRA FÖRESTÅENDE!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ТЕПЛОВИЙ РОЗГІН! МОЖЛИВА ПОЖЕЖА АБО ВИБУХ НЕМИНУЧІ!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_UNKNOWN_EVENT_SET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>An unknown event was set! Review your code!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ein unbekanntes Ereignis wurde gesetzt! Code überprüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tuntematon tapahtuma asetettiin! Tarkista koodisi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Un événement inconnu a été déclenché! Vérifiez votre code!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ismeretlen esemény lett beállítva! Ellenőrizze a kódot!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Een onbekende gebeurtenis werd gezet! Controleer uw code!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>En okänd händelse sattes! Granska din kod!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Встановлено невідому подію! Перевірте свій код!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_VOLTAGE_DIFFERENCE_BAT2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Too large voltage diff between the batteries. Second battery cannot join the DC-link</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zu große Spannungsdifferenz zwischen den Batterien. Zweite Batterie kann nicht in den DC-Zwischenkreis einkoppeln</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Liian suuri jänniteero akkujen välillä. Toinen akku ei voi liittyä DC-väylään</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Écart de tension trop grand entre les batteries. La deuxième batterie ne peut pas rejoindre le bus DC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Túl nagy feszültségkülönbség az akkumulátorok között. A második akkumulátor nem csatlakozhat a DC-linkhez</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Te groot spanningsverschil tussen de batterijen. Tweede batterij kan niet aan de DC-link deelnemen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>För stor spänningsskillnad mellan batterierna. Andra batteriet kan inte ansluta till DC-länken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Занадто велика різниця напруг між батареями. Друга батарея не може під'єднатися до DC-шини</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_VOLTAGE_DIFFERENCE_BAT3</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Too large voltage diff between the batteries. Third battery cannot join the DC-link</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zu große Spannungsdifferenz zwischen den Batterien. Dritte Batterie kann nicht in den DC-Zwischenkreis einkoppeln</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Liian suuri jänniteero akkujen välillä. Kolmas akku ei voi liittyä DC-väylään</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Écart de tension trop grand entre les batteries. La troisième batterie ne peut pas rejoindre le bus DC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Túl nagy feszültségkülönbség az akkumulátorok között. A harmadik akkumulátor nem csatlakozhat a DC-linkhez</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Te groot spanningsverschil tussen de batterijen. Derde batterij kan niet aan de DC-link deelnemen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>För stor spänningsskillnad mellan batterierna. Tredje batteriet kan inte ansluta till DC-länken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Занадто велика різниця напруг між батареями. Третя батарея не може під'єднатися до DC-шини</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_WATER_INGRESS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Water leakage inside battery detected. Operation halted. Inspect battery!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wasserleckage in der Batterie erkannt. Betrieb angehalten. Batterie prüfen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vesivuoto akun sisällä havaittu. Toiminta pysäytetty. Tarkasta akku!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fuite d'eau détectée dans la batterie. Fonctionnement arrêté. Inspectez la batterie!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vízszivárgás észlelve az akkumulátorban. A működés leállítva. Ellenőrizze az akkumulátort!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Waterlekkage in batterij gedetecteerd. Werking gestopt. Controleer batterij!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vattenläckage inuti batteriet har detekterats. Driften har stoppats. Inspektera batteriet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Виявлено протікання води всередині батареї. Роботу зупинено. Огляньте батарею!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_WIFI_AP_PASSWORD_DEFAULT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>The AP will be disabled after 5 idle minutes. Change default password to keep AP constantly on!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der AP wird nach 5 Minuten Inaktivität deaktiviert. Standardpasswort ändern, damit der AP dauerhaft aktiv bleibt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>AP poistetaan käytöstä 5 minuutin käyttämättömyyden jälkeen. Vaihda oletussalasana pitääksesi AP:n jatkuvasti päällä!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'AP sera désactivé après 5 minutes d'inactivité. Changez le mot de passe par défaut pour garder l'AP toujours actif!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az AP 5 tétlen perc után letiltásra kerül. Módosítsa az alapértelmezett jelszót, hogy az AP folyamatosan bekapcsolva maradjon!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Het AP wordt na 5 minuten inactiviteit uitgeschakeld. Wijzig het standaardwachtwoord om het AP altijd aan te houden!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>AP:n inaktiveras efter 5 minuters inaktivitet. Ändra standardlösenordet för att hålla AP:n ständigt på!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>AP буде вимкнено після 5 хвилин бездіяльності. Змініть стандартний пароль, щоб AP залишалася постійно ввімкненою!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EVENT_WIFI_AP_PROVISION_TIMEOUT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wifi AP disabled due to cybersecurity concern. Change default password to keep AP constantly on! Reboot/Hold BOOT button 5-15 seconds to re-enable AP temporarily.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WiFi-AP aus Cybersicherheitsgründen deaktiviert. Standardpasswort ändern, damit der AP dauerhaft aktiv bleibt! Neustarten/BOOT-Taste 5-15 Sekunden halten, um den AP vorübergehend zu reaktivieren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WiFi-AP poistettu käytöstä kyberturvallisuussyistä. Vaihda oletussalasana pitääksesi AP:n jatkuvasti päällä! Käynnistä uudelleen / pidä BOOT-painiketta 5-15 sekuntia ottaaksesi AP:n väliaikaisesti uudelleen käyttöön.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>AP WiFi désactivé pour raison de cybersécurité. Changer le mot de passe par défaut pour garder l'AP toujours actif! Redémarrer/maintenir le bouton BOOT 5-15 secondes pour réactiver l'AP temporairement.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A WiFi AP kiberbiztonsági okból letiltva. Változtassa meg az alapértelmezett jelszót, hogy az AP folyamatosan aktív maradjon! Újraindítás/BOOT gomb 5-15 másodpercig nyomva tartása ideiglenesen újra engedélyezi az AP-t.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WiFi-AP uitgeschakeld vanwege cyberbeveiligingsrisico. Wijzig het standaardwachtwoord om de AP continu aan te houden! Herstart/houd de BOOT-knop 5-15 seconden ingedrukt om de AP tijdelijk weer in te schakelen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WiFi-AP inaktiverad av cybersäkerhetsskäl. Ändra standardlösenordet för att behålla AP konstant på! Starta om / håll BOOT-knappen i 5-15 sekunder för att tillfälligt återaktivera AP.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WiFi AP вимкнено з міркувань кібербезпеки. Змініть стандартний пароль, щоб зберегти AP постійно увімкненою! Перезавантажте / утримуйте кнопку BOOT 5-15 секунд, щоб тимчасово знову увімкнути AP.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
