<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_BELOW_20_ABOVE_80_SOC_LIMIT_POWER_VALUE_SOC_E_G_50_W_MEANS_150W_AT_3_500W_AT_10</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Below 20% and above 80% SOC, limit power to this value * SOC% (e.g. 50 W/% means 150W at 3%, 500W at 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Unter 20% und über 80% SOC die Leistung auf diesen Wert * SOC% begrenzen (z. B. 50 W/% bedeutet 150W bei 3%, 500W bei 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Alle 20% ja yli 80% SOC:lla teho rajoitetaan tähän arvoon * SOC% (esim. 50 W/% tarkoittaa 150W 3%:ssa, 500W 10%:ssa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>En dessous de 20% et au-dessus de 80% de SOC, limiter la puissance à cette valeur * SOC% (ex. 50 W/% donne 150W à 3%, 500W à 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>20% alatt és 80% SOC felett a teljesítmény korlátozása erre az értékre * SOC% (pl. 50 W/% esetén 150W 3%-nál, 500W 10%-nál)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Onder 20% en boven 80% SOC, beperk vermogen tot deze waarde * SOC% (bijv. 50 W/% betekent 150W bij 3%, 500W bij 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Under 20% och över 80% SOC begränsas effekten till detta värde * SOC% (t.ex. 50 W/% ger 150W vid 3%, 500W vid 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Нижче 20% і вище 80% SOC обмежувати потужність до цього значення * SOC% (напр., 50 W/% означає 150W при 3%, 500W при 10%)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
