<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_CONTINOUS_MAX_CHARGE_POWER_USED_SINCE_CAN_DATA_NOT_VALID_INTEGRATION_DO_NOT_SET_TOO_HIGH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Continous max charge power. Used since CAN data not valid for this integration. Do not set too high!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontinuierliche max. Ladeleistung. Verwendet, da CAN-Daten für diese Integration nicht gültig sind. Nicht zu hoch einstellen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jatkuva maksimilatausteho. Käytetään, koska CAN-data ei ole kelvollista tälle integraatiolle. Älä aseta liian korkeaksi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puissance de charge max continue. Utilisée car les données CAN ne sont pas valides pour cette intégration. Ne pas régler trop haut!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Folyamatos max. töltési teljesítmény. Azért használatos, mert a CAN-adatok nem érvényesek ehhez az integrációhoz. Ne állítsa túl magasra!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Continu maximaal laadvermogen. Gebruikt omdat CAN-data niet geldig is voor deze integratie. Niet te hoog instellen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontinuerlig max laddeffekt. Används eftersom CAN-data inte är giltig för denna integration. Ställ inte för högt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Постійна макс. потужність заряджання. Використовується, оскільки дані CAN недійсні для цієї інтеграції. Не встановлюйте занадто високо!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_CONTINOUS_MAX_DISCHARGE_POWER_USED_SINCE_CAN_DATA_NOT_VALID_INTEGRATION_DO_NOT_SET_TOO_HIGH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Continous max discharge power. Used since CAN data not valid for this integration. Do not set too high!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontinuierliche max. Entladeleistung. Verwendet, da CAN-Daten für diese Integration nicht gültig sind. Nicht zu hoch einstellen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jatkuva maksimipurkuteho. Käytetään, koska CAN-data ei ole kelvollista tälle integraatiolle. Älä aseta liian korkeaksi!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puissance de décharge max continue. Utilisée car les données CAN ne sont pas valides pour cette intégration. Ne pas régler trop haut!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Folyamatos max. kisütési teljesítmény. Azért használatos, mert a CAN-adatok nem érvényesek ehhez az integrációhoz. Ne állítsa túl magasra!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Continu maximaal ontlaadvermogen. Gebruikt omdat CAN-data niet geldig is voor deze integratie. Niet te hoog instellen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kontinuerlig max urladdningseffekt. Används eftersom CAN-data inte är giltig för denna integration. Ställ inte för högt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Постійна макс. потужність розряджання. Використовується, оскільки дані CAN недійсні для цієї інтеграції. Не встановлюйте занадто високо!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_DEVELOPERS_GET_DETAILED_PERFORMANCE_METRICS_FRONT_PAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>For developers. Get detailed performance metrics on the front page</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Für Entwickler. Detaillierte Leistungsmetriken auf der Startseite anzeigen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kehittäjille. Näytä yksityiskohtaiset suorituskykymittarit etusivulla</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Pour les développeurs. Affiche des métriques de performance détaillées sur la page d'accueil</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fejlesztőknek. Részletes teljesítménymetrikák megjelenítése a főoldalon</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voor ontwikkelaars. Toon gedetailleerde prestatiestatistieken op de voorpagina</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>För utvecklare. Få detaljerade prestandamått på startsidan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Для розробників. Отримуйте докладні метрики продуктивності на головній сторінці</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_DE_GERMANY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Germany)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Deutschland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Saksa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Allemagne)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Németország)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Duitsland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Tyskland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DE (Німеччина)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_DK_DENMARK</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Denmark)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Dänemark)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Tanska)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Danemark)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Dánia)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Denemarken)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Danmark)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DK (Данія)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_DNS_RESOLVER_LEAVE_BLANK_USE_GATEWAY_WHICH_CORRECT_MOST_HOME_NETWORKS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS resolver. Leave blank to use the gateway, which is correct on most home networks.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-Resolver. Leer lassen, um das Gateway zu verwenden, was in den meisten Heimnetzwerken korrekt ist.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-palvelin. Jätä tyhjäksi käyttääksesi yhdyskäytävää, mikä on oikein useimmissa kotiverkoissa.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Résolveur DNS. Laisser vide pour utiliser la passerelle, ce qui convient à la plupart des réseaux domestiques.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-feloldó. Hagyja üresen az átjáró használatához, ami a legtöbb otthoni hálózaton megfelelő.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-resolver. Laat leeg om de gateway te gebruiken, wat correct is voor de meeste thuisnetwerken.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-server. Lämna tomt för att använda gatewayen, vilket är korrekt på de flesta hemnätverk.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DNS-сервер. Залиште порожнім, щоб використовувати шлюз — це правильно для більшості домашніх мереж.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_ENABLE_IF_YOU_WANT_GENERAL_LOGGING_AVAILABLE_WEBSERVER</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable this if you want general logging available in the Webserver.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivieren, wenn allgemeines Logging im Webserver verfügbar sein soll.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota tämä käyttöön, jos haluat yleisen lokituksen käyttöön verkkopalvelimessa.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer pour rendre la journalisation générale disponible dans le serveur web.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engedélyezze, ha általános naplózást szeretne a webszerveren.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel dit in als u algemene logging beschikbaar wilt in de webserver.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera detta om du vill ha allmän loggning tillgänglig i webbservern.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть це, якщо хочете, щоб загальне журналювання було доступне у вебсервері.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_ENABLE_OPTION_IF_YOU_INTEND_RUN_THREE_BATTERIES_PARALLEL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable this option if you intend to run three batteries in parallel</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Diese Option aktivieren, wenn drei Batterien parallel betrieben werden sollen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota tämä valinta käyttöön, jos aiot käyttää kolmea akkua rinnakkain</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer cette option si vous comptez utiliser trois batteries en parallèle</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engedélyezze ezt az opciót, ha három akkumulátort kíván párhuzamosan üzemeltetni</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel deze optie in als u drie batterijen parallel wilt gebruiken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera detta alternativ om du avser att köra tre batterier parallellt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть цю опцію, якщо плануєте використовувати три батареї паралельно</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_ENABLE_OPTION_IF_YOU_INTEND_RUN_TWO_BATTERIES_PARALLEL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable this option if you intend to run two batteries in parallel</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Diese Option aktivieren, wenn zwei Batterien parallel betrieben werden sollen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota tämä valinta käyttöön, jos aiot käyttää kahta akkua rinnakkain</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer cette option si vous comptez utiliser deux batteries en parallèle</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engedélyezze ezt az opciót, ha két akkumulátort kíván párhuzamosan üzemeltetni</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel deze optie in als u twee batterijen parallel wilt gebruiken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera detta alternativ om du avser att köra två batterier parallellt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть цю опцію, якщо плануєте використовувати дві батареї паралельно</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_ENERGY_FLOW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energy Flow</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energiefluss</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energiavirta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Flux d'énergie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energiaáramlás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energiestroom</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Energiflöde</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Потік енергії</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_EU_EUROPE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Europe)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Europa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Eurooppa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Europe)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Európa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Europa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Europa)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EU (Європа)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_EXTREMELY_RARE_OPTION_IF_CONFIGURED_GPIO_CONTROL_LOGIC_WILL_INVERTED_OPERATION_NORMALLY_CLOSED_CONTACTORS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extremely rare option. If configured, GPIO control logic will be inverted for operation with normally closed contactors</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extrem seltene Option. Wenn konfiguriert, wird die GPIO-Steuerlogik für den Betrieb mit Öffner-Schützen (normally closed) invertiert</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erittäin harvinainen valinta. Jos määritetty, GPIO-ohjauslogiikka käännetään toimimaan normaalisti suljettujen kontaktorien kanssa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Option extrêmement rare. Si configurée, la logique de commande GPIO sera inversée pour fonctionner avec des contacteurs normalement fermés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Rendkívül ritka opció. Ha be van állítva, a GPIO vezérlési logika invertálva lesz az alaphelyzetben zárt mágneskapcsolókkal való működéshez</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zeer zeldzame optie. Indien geconfigureerd wordt de GPIO-besturingslogica geïnverteerd voor gebruik met normaal gesloten contactoren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extremt sällsynt alternativ. Om det konfigureras inverteras GPIO-styrlogiken för drift med normalt slutna kontaktorer</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Надзвичайно рідкісна опція. Якщо налаштовано, логіку керування GPIO буде інвертовано для роботи з нормально замкненими контакторами</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_E_STOP_BMS_POWER</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>E-Stop / BMS Power</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>E-Stop / BMS-Versorgung</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hätäpysäytys / BMS-virta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Arrêt d'urgence / alimentation BMS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>E-Stop / BMS táp</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>E-Stop / BMS-voeding</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nödstopp / BMS-ström</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Аварійна зупинка / живлення BMS</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_FORCE_SPECIFIC_CHANNEL_SET_0_AUTODETECT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Force specific channel. Set to 0 for autodetect</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bestimmten Kanal erzwingen. 0 = automatische Erkennung</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Pakota tietty kanava. Aseta 0 automaattista tunnistusta varten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Forcer un canal spécifique. Mettre 0 pour la détection automatique</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adott csatorna kényszerítése. 0 = automatikus felismerés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Forceer een specifiek kanaal. Zet op 0 voor autodetectie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tvinga specifik kanal. Sätt till 0 för automatisk detektering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Примусово задати канал. Встановіть 0 для автовизначення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_FREQUENCY_HZ_USED_PWM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Frequency in Hz used for PWM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Für PWM verwendete Frequenz in Hz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>PWM:ssä käytettävä taajuus (Hz)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fréquence en Hz utilisée pour le PWM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A PWM-hez használt frekvencia Hz-ben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Frequentie in Hz voor PWM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Frekvens i Hz som används för PWM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Частота в Hz для PWM</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_GB_UK_N_IRELAND</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (UK &amp; N Ireland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (UK &amp; Nordirland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (Iso-Britannia ja Pohjois-Irlanti)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (Royaume-Uni et Irlande du Nord)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (Egyesült Királyság és Észak-Írország)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (VK &amp; N-Ierland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (Storbritannien &amp; Nordirland)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GB (Велика Британія та Північна Ірландія)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_GIVES_UP_ONE_OCCURRENCE_IF_BATTERY_REPORTS_BALANCING_AS_ACTIVE_NEXT_OCCURRENCE_RUNS_EVEN_IF_BALANCING_STILL_ACTIVE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gives up one occurrence if the battery reports balancing as active. The next occurrence runs even if balancing is still active</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Setzt ein Vorkommen aus, wenn die Batterie Balancing als aktiv meldet. Das nächste Vorkommen läuft auch dann, wenn Balancing noch aktiv ist</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ohittaa yhden kerran, jos akku ilmoittaa balansoinnin olevan käynnissä. Seuraava kerta suoritetaan, vaikka balansointi olisi yhä käynnissä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saute une occurrence si la batterie signale l'équilibrage comme actif. L'occurrence suivante s'exécute même si l'équilibrage est toujours actif</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kihagy egy alkalmat, ha az akkumulátor aktív kiegyenlítést jelez. A következő alkalom akkor is lefut, ha a kiegyenlítés még aktív</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Slaat één keer over als de batterij balanceren als actief meldt. De volgende keer wordt uitgevoerd, ook als balanceren nog actief is</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoppar över ett tillfälle om batteriet rapporterar att balansering pågår. Nästa tillfälle körs även om balanseringen fortfarande pågår</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Пропускає одне спрацювання, якщо батарея повідомляє про активне балансування. Наступне спрацювання виконується, навіть якщо балансування ще триває</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_GRB_CLASSIC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Classic</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Klassisch</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB klassinen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Classique</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB klasszikus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Klassiek</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB klassisk</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB класичний</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_GRB_ENERGY_FLOW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Energy Flow</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Energiefluss</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB energiavirta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Flux d'énergie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB energiaáramlás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Energiestroom</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB energiflöde</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB потік енергії</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_GRB_HEARTBEAT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Heartbeat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Herzschlag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB syke</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Heartbeat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB szívverés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB Hartslag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB hjärtslag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GRB серцебиття</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_HEARTBEAT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Heartbeat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Herzschlag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Syke</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Heartbeat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Szívverés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hartslag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hjärtslag</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Серцебиття</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_HOLDS_RESET_BACK_WHILE_EITHER_REAL_SCALED_SOC_BELOW_15_PERCENT_IT_RUNS_AS_SOON_AS_SOC_RECOVERS_INTERVAL_RESTARTS_FROM_POINT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Holds the reset back while either the real or the scaled SOC is below 15 percent. It runs as soon as SOC recovers, and the interval restarts from that point</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hält den Reset zurück, solange der reale oder der skalierte SOC unter 15 Prozent liegt. Er läuft, sobald sich der SOC erholt, und das Intervall startet ab diesem Punkt neu</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Viivyttää nollausta, kun todellinen tai skaalattu SOC on alle 15 prosenttia. Se suoritetaan heti, kun SOC palautuu, ja väli alkaa alusta siitä hetkestä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Retient la réinitialisation tant que le SOC réel ou mis à l'échelle est sous 15 pour cent. Elle s'exécute dès que le SOC remonte, et l'intervalle repart de ce point</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Visszatartja a visszaállítást, amíg a valós vagy a skálázott SOC 15 százalék alatt van. Amint a SOC helyreáll, lefut, és az intervallum onnantól újraindul</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Houdt de reset tegen zolang de werkelijke of de geschaalde SOC onder 15 procent is. De reset wordt uitgevoerd zodra de SOC herstelt, en het interval start vanaf dat punt opnieuw</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Håller tillbaka återställningen medan antingen verklig eller skalad SOC är under 15 procent. Den körs så snart SOC återhämtat sig, och intervallet startar om från den punkten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Відкладає скидання, поки реальний або масштабований SOC нижче 15 відсотків. Воно виконується щойно SOC відновиться, і інтервал перезапускається з цього моменту</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_HOSTNAME_LETTERS_NUMBERS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hostname (letters, numbers, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hostname (Buchstaben, Zahlen, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Isäntänimi (kirjaimet, numerot, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nom d'hôte (lettres, chiffres, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Állomásnév (betűk, számok, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hostnaam (letters, cijfers, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Värdnamn (bokstäver, siffror, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ім'я хоста (літери, цифри, '.', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_HOW_OFTEN_PUBLISH_MQTT_MESSAGES_SECONDS_1_300_STEP_1_DEFAULT_5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>How often to publish MQTT messages in seconds (1-300, step 1). Default: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wie oft MQTT-Nachrichten veröffentlicht werden, in Sekunden (1-300, Schritt 1). Standard: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kuinka usein MQTT-viestit julkaistaan sekunneissa (1-300, askel 1). Oletus: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fréquence de publication des messages MQTT en secondes (1-300, pas de 1). Défaut: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Milyen gyakran küldjön MQTT-üzeneteket, másodpercben (1-300, lépés: 1). Alapértelmezés: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoe vaak MQTT-berichten worden gepubliceerd in seconden (1-300, stap 1). Standaard: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hur ofta MQTT-meddelanden publiceras i sekunder (1-300, steg 1). Standard: 5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Як часто публікувати повідомлення MQTT у секундах (1-300, крок 1). Типово: 5</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_I2C_DISPLAY_SSD1306</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C Display (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C-Display (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C-näyttö (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Écran I2C (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C kijelző (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C-display (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>I2C-display (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Дисплей I2C (SSD1306)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
