<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_IF_ENABLED_CPU_TEMPERATURE_WILL_DISPLAYED_WEBSERVER</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>If enabled, the CPU temperature will be displayed on webserver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wenn aktiviert, wird die CPU-Temperatur im Webserver angezeigt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jos käytössä, CPU:n lämpötila näytetään verkkopalvelimessa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Si activé, la température du CPU sera affichée sur le serveur web</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ha engedélyezve van, a CPU hőmérséklete megjelenik a webszerveren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Indien ingeschakeld wordt de CPU-temperatuur weergegeven op de webserver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Om aktiverat visas CPU-temperaturen på webbservern</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Якщо ввімкнено, температура CPU відображатиметься на вебсервері</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
