<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_INVERT_CURRENT_READING_FROM_CT_CLAMP_VE_CHARGING_VE_DISCHARGING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invert the current reading from the CT clamp, +ve is charging, -ve is discharging</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Strommesswert der CT-Klemme invertieren, +ve = Laden, -ve = Entladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Käännä CT-pihtien virtalukema, +ve on lataus, -ve on purkaus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverser la lecture du courant de la pince CT, +ve = charge, -ve = décharge</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CT lakatfogó áramértékének invertálása, +ve = töltés, -ve = kisütés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverteer de stroommeting van de CT-klem, +ve is laden, -ve is ontladen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertera strömavläsningen från CT-klämman, +ve är laddning, -ve är urladdning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертувати покази струму з кліщів CT, +ve — заряджання, -ve — розряджання</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
