<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_IPV4_ADDRESS_YOUR_ROUTER</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>IPv4 address of your router</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>IPv4-Adresse Ihres Routers</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Reitittimesi IPv4-osoite</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adresse IPv4 de votre routeur</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A router IPv4-címe</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>IPv4-adres van uw router</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>IPv4-adress till din router</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>IPv4-адреса вашого маршрутизатора</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_JP_JAPAN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japani)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japon)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japán)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Japan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>JP (Японія)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_KEEP_CONTACTORS_ALWAYS_CLOSED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Keep contactors always closed</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schütze immer geschlossen halten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Pidä kontaktorit aina suljettuina</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Garder les contacteurs toujours fermés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsolók tartása mindig zárva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Houd contactoren altijd gesloten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Håll kontaktorer alltid stängda</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тримати контактори завжди замкненими</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_KR_KOREA</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Corée)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Korea)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KR (Корея)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_LATCHING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Latching</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Rastend</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lukittuva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>À verrouillage</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Reteszelő</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vergrendelend</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Låsande</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>З фіксацією</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_LINEARLY_REDUCES_ALLOWED_CHARGE_POWER_FROM_FULL_POWER_AT_START_SOC_DOWN_0W_AT_100PCT_SCALED_SOC_SMOOTH_APPROACH_FULL_INSTEAD_ABRUPT_CUTOFF_MANDATORY_ALWAYS_ENABLED_SOME_BATTERY_TYPES</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Linearly reduces the allowed charge power from full power at the start SOC down to 0W at 100pct scaled SOC, for a smooth approach to full instead of an abrupt cutoff. Mandatory and always enabled for some battery types.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Reduziert die zulässige Ladeleistung linear von voller Leistung beim Start-SOC bis auf 0W bei 100% skaliertem SOC, für eine sanfte Annäherung an voll statt eines abrupten Abschaltens. Für einige Batterietypen obligatorisch und immer aktiviert.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vähentää sallittua lataustehoa lineaarisesti täydestä tehosta aloitus-SOC:sta 0W:iin 100pct skaalatussa SOC:ssa, jotta täyteen lataus päättyy pehmeästi äkillisen katkaisun sijaan. Pakollinen ja aina käytössä joillakin akkutyypeillä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réduit linéairement la puissance de charge autorisée depuis la pleine puissance au SOC de départ jusqu'à 0W à 100pct de SOC mis à l'échelle, pour une approche en douceur de la pleine charge au lieu d'une coupure brutale. Obligatoire et toujours activé pour certains types de batterie.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lineárisan csökkenti az engedélyezett töltési teljesítményt a kezdő SOC-nál lévő teljes teljesítményről 0W-ra 100% skálázott SOC-nál, a hirtelen levágás helyett sima megközelítést adva a teljes töltöttséghez. Egyes akkumulátortípusoknál kötelező és mindig engedélyezett.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verlaagt het toegestane laadvermogen lineair van vol vermogen bij de start-SOC tot 0W bij 100pct geschaalde SOC, voor een geleidelijke nadering van vol in plaats van een abrupte afsluiting. Verplicht en altijd ingeschakeld voor sommige batterijtypes.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minskar tillåten laddeffekt linjärt från full effekt vid start-SOC ner till 0W vid 100pct skalad SOC, för en mjuk avslutning mot fullt i stället för ett abrupt avbrott. Obligatoriskt och alltid aktiverat för vissa batterityper.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Лінійно зменшує дозволену потужність заряджання від повної потужності на початковому SOC до 0W на 100pct масштабованого SOC для плавного наближення до повного заряду замість різкого відсікання. Обов'язково та завжди увімкнено для деяких типів батарей.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_LOCK_CONTACTORS_CLOSED_AFTER_FIRST_CLOSE_REQUEST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lock contactors closed after first close request</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schütze nach der ersten Schließanforderung geschlossen verriegeln</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lukitse kontaktorit kiinni ensimmäisen sulkupyynnön jälkeen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verrouiller les contacteurs fermés après la première demande de fermeture</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsolók zárva tartása az első zárási kérés után</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vergrendel contactoren gesloten na het eerste sluitverzoek</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lås kontaktorerna stängda efter första stängningsbegäran</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Блокувати контактори замкненими після першого запиту на замикання</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAXIMUM_ALLOWED_CHARGE_DISCHARGE_POWER_AT_EXACTLY_0_C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximum allowed charge/discharge power at exactly 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximal zulässige Lade-/Entladeleistung bei genau 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suurin sallittu lataus-/purkuteho tasan 0°C:ssa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puissance de charge/décharge maximale autorisée à exactement 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximális engedélyezett töltési/kisütési teljesítmény pontosan 0°C-on</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximaal toegestaan laad-/ontlaadvermogen bij precies 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximal tillåten ladd-/urladdningseffekt vid exakt 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Максимально дозволена потужність заряджання/розряджання рівно при 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAXIMUM_SAFE_VOLTAGE_ENTIRE_BATTERY_PACK_VOLTS_USED_AS_CHARGE_TARGET_PROTECTION_LIMITS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximum safe voltage for the entire battery pack in volts. Used as charge target and protection limits.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale sichere Spannung des gesamten Batteriepacks in Volt. Wird als Ladeziel und für Schutzgrenzen verwendet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Koko akkupaketin suurin turvallinen jännite voltteina. Käytetään latauksen tavoitteena ja suojarajoina.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension maximale sûre pour l'ensemble du pack batterie en volts. Utilisée comme cible de charge et limites de protection.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A teljes akkumulátorpakk maximális biztonságos feszültsége voltban. Töltési célként és védelmi határként szolgál.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale veilige spanning voor het gehele batterijpak in volt. Gebruikt als laaddoel en beschermingslimieten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Högsta säkra spänning för hela batteripaketet i volt. Används som laddmål och skyddsgränser.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Максимальна безпечна напруга для всього акумуляторного блока у вольтах. Використовується як ціль заряджання та межі захисту.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAXIMUM_VOLTAGE_PER_INDIVIDUAL_CELL_MILLIVOLTS_CHARGING_STOPS_IF_ONE_CELL_REACHES_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximum voltage per individual cell in millivolts. Charging stops if one cell reaches this voltage.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale Spannung pro Einzelzelle in Millivolt. Das Laden stoppt, wenn eine Zelle diese Spannung erreicht.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yksittäisen kennon suurin jännite millivoltteina. Lataus pysähtyy, jos yksi kenno saavuttaa tämän jännitteen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension maximale par cellule individuelle en millivolts. La charge s'arrête si une cellule atteint cette tension.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cellánkénti maximális feszültség millivoltban. A töltés leáll, ha egy cella eléri ezt a feszültséget.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale spanning per individuele cel in millivolt. Laden stopt als één cel deze spanning bereikt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Högsta spänning per enskild cell i millivolt. Laddningen stoppas om en cell når denna spänning.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Максимальна напруга окремої комірки в мілівольтах. Заряджання зупиняється, якщо одна комірка досягає цієї напруги.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAX_63_CHARACTERS_PRINTABLE_ASCII_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max 63 characters, printable ASCII only</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max. 63 Zeichen, nur druckbares ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enintään 63 merkkiä, vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max 63 caractères, ASCII imprimable uniquement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max. 63 karakter, csak nyomtatható ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max 63 tekens, alleen afdrukbare ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max 63 tecken, endast utskrivbar ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Максимум 63 символи, лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAX_POWER_ADDED_REMOVED_PER_DEGREE_ABOVE_BELOW_0_C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max power added or removed per degree above or below 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max. Leistung, die pro Grad über oder unter 0°C hinzugefügt oder entfernt wird</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suurin teho, joka lisätään tai poistetaan astetta kohden 0°C:n ylä- tai alapuolella</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puissance max ajoutée ou retirée par degré au-dessus ou en dessous de 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fokonként hozzáadott vagy levont max. teljesítmény 0°C felett vagy alatt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max vermogen toegevoegd of verwijderd per graad boven of onder 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max effekt som läggs till eller dras ifrån per grad över eller under 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Макс. потужність, що додається або віднімається на градус вище чи нижче 0°C</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MAX_POWER_PER_DV_WHEN_APPROACHING_DISCHARGE_VOLTAGE_LIMIT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max power per dV when approaching the discharge voltage limit</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max. Leistung pro dV bei Annäherung an die Entladespannungsgrenze</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Suurin teho per dV lähestyttäessä purkujännitteen rajaa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Puissance max par dV à l'approche de la limite de tension de décharge</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max. teljesítmény dV-onként a kisütési feszültséghatár megközelítésekor</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max vermogen per dV bij nadering van de ontlaadspanningslimiet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Max effekt per dV vid närmande till urladdningsspänningsgränsen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Макс. потужність на dV при наближенні до межі напруги розряджання</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_ME_MIDDLE_EAST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Middle East)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Naher Osten)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Lähi-itä)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Moyen-Orient)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Közel-Kelet)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Midden-Oosten)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Mellanöstern)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ME (Близький Схід)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MINIMUM_SAFE_VOLTAGE_ENTIRE_BATTERY_PACK_VOLTS_FURTHER_DISCHARGE_NOT_POSSIBLE_BELOW_LIMIT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimum safe voltage for the entire battery pack in volts. Further discharge not possible below this limit.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimale sichere Spannung des gesamten Batteriepacks in Volt. Unterhalb dieser Grenze ist keine weitere Entladung möglich.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Koko akkupaketin pienin turvallinen jännite voltteina. Purku ei ole mahdollista tämän rajan alapuolella.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension minimale sûre pour l'ensemble du pack batterie en volts. Décharge supplémentaire impossible sous cette limite.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A teljes akkumulátorpakk minimális biztonságos feszültsége voltban. E határ alatt további kisütés nem lehetséges.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimale veilige spanning voor het gehele batterijpak in volt. Verder ontladen niet mogelijk onder deze limiet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lägsta säkra spänning för hela batteripaketet i volt. Ytterligare urladdning är inte möjlig under denna gräns.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Мінімальна безпечна напруга для всього акумуляторного блока у вольтах. Подальше розряджання нижче цієї межі неможливе.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE_PER_INDIVIDUAL_CELL_MILLIVOLTS_DISCHARGE_STOPS_IF_ONE_CELL_DROPS_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimum voltage per individual cell in millivolts. Discharge stops if one cell drops to this voltage.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimale Spannung pro Einzelzelle in Millivolt. Das Entladen stoppt, wenn eine Zelle auf diese Spannung absinkt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yksittäisen kennon pienin jännite millivoltteina. Purku pysähtyy, jos yksi kenno laskee tähän jännitteeseen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension minimale par cellule individuelle en millivolts. La décharge s'arrête si une cellule descend à cette tension.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cellánkénti minimális feszültség millivoltban. A kisütés leáll, ha egy cella erre a feszültségre csökken.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Minimale spanning per individuele cel in millivolt. Ontladen stopt als één cel tot deze spanning daalt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lägsta spänning per enskild cell i millivolt. Urladdningen stoppas om en cell sjunker till denna spänning.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Мінімальна напруга окремої комірки в мілівольтах. Розряджання зупиняється, якщо одна комірка опускається до цієї напруги.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
