<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MQTT_AUTO_DISCOVERY_BASE_TOPIC_LETTERS_NUMBERS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT auto discovery base topic (letters, numbers, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-Auto-Discovery-Basis-Topic (Buchstaben, Zahlen, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT auto discovery -perusaihe (kirjaimet, numerot, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Topic de base de la découverte automatique MQTT (lettres, chiffres, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT automatikus felderítés alap topic (betűk, számok, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT auto-discovery-basistopic (letters, cijfers, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bastopic för MQTT auto discovery (bokstäver, siffror, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Базовий топік MQTT auto discovery (літери, цифри, '_', '-')</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MQTT_PASSWORD_CAN_ONLY_CONTAIN_PRINTABLE_ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT password can only contain printable ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-Passwort darf nur druckbares ASCII enthalten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-salasana voi sisältää vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le mot de passe MQTT ne peut contenir que de l'ASCII imprimable</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az MQTT-jelszó csak nyomtatható ASCII karaktereket tartalmazhat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-wachtwoord mag alleen afdrukbare ASCII bevatten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-lösenord får endast innehålla utskrivbara ASCII-tecken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Пароль MQTT може містити лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_MQTT_USERNAME_CAN_ONLY_CONTAIN_PRINTABLE_ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT username can only contain printable ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-Benutzername darf nur druckbares ASCII enthalten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-käyttäjätunnus voi sisältää vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le nom d'utilisateur MQTT ne peut contenir que de l'ASCII imprimable</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az MQTT-felhasználónév csak nyomtatható ASCII karaktereket tartalmazhat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-gebruikersnaam mag alleen afdrukbare ASCII bevatten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>MQTT-användarnamn får endast innehålla utskrivbara ASCII-tecken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ім'я користувача MQTT може містити лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_NOMINAL_CURRENT_CT_CLAMP_INTEGER_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominal current of the CT Clamp. Integer only.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nennstrom der CT-Klemme. Nur ganze Zahlen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CT-pihdin nimellisvirta. Vain kokonaisluku.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Courant nominal de la pince CT. Entier uniquement.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CT lakatfogó névleges árama. Csak egész szám.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominale stroom van de CT-klem. Alleen gehele getallen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominell ström för CT-klämman. Endast heltal.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Номінальний струм CT-кліщів. Лише ціле число.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_NOMINAL_VOLTAGE_CT_CLAMP_X10_INTEGER_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominal voltage of the CT Clamp x10. Integer only.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nennspannung der CT-Klemme x10. Nur ganze Zahlen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CT-pihdin nimellisjännite x10. Vain kokonaisluku.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension nominale de la pince CT x10. Entier uniquement.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A CT lakatfogó névleges feszültsége x10. Csak egész szám.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominale spanning van de CT-klem x10. Alleen gehele getallen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nominell spänning för CT-klämman x10. Endast heltal.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Номінальна напруга CT-кліщів x10. Лише ціле число.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_NONE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>NONE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>KEINE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>EI MITÄÄN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>AUCUNE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>NINCS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>GEEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>INGEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>НЕМАЄ</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_NOT_CONNECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Not connected</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nicht verbunden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ei yhdistetty</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Non connecté</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nincs csatlakoztatva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Niet aangesloten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ej ansluten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не підключено</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_NO_WORKAROUND</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>No Workaround</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kein Workaround</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ei kiertotapaa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aucun contournement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nincs kerülő megoldás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Geen workaround</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ingen workaround</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Без обхідного рішення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_OPTIONAL_HOSTNAME_MAY_ONLY_CONTAIN_LETTERS_NUMBERS_IF_MQTT_ENABLED_TOPIC_NAME_OBJECT_ID_PREFIX_HA_DEVICE_NAME_ID_WILL_ALSO_SET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Optional: Hostname may only contain letters, numbers and '-'. If MQTT enabled, Topic name, Object ID prefix, HA device name and ID will be also set to this.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Optional: Hostname darf nur Buchstaben, Zahlen und '-' enthalten. Wenn MQTT aktiviert ist, werden Topic-Name, Object-ID-Präfix, HA-Gerätename und -ID ebenfalls darauf gesetzt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valinnainen: Isäntänimi saa sisältää vain kirjaimia, numeroita ja '-'. Jos MQTT on käytössä, myös aiheen nimi, objekti-ID-etuliite, HA-laitteen nimi ja ID asetetaan täksi.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Optionnel: le nom d'hôte ne peut contenir que des lettres, des chiffres et '-'. Si MQTT est activé, le nom de topic, le préfixe d'Object ID, le nom et l'ID de l'appareil HA seront aussi définis à cette valeur.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Opcionális: Az állomásnév csak betűket, számokat és '-' jelet tartalmazhat. Ha az MQTT engedélyezett, a Topic név, az Object ID előtag, a HA eszköznév és azonosító is erre lesz állítva.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Optioneel: hostnaam mag alleen letters, cijfers en '-' bevatten. Als MQTT is ingeschakeld, worden topicnaam, Object-ID-prefix, HA-apparaatnaam en -ID hier ook op ingesteld.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valfritt: Värdnamnet får endast innehålla bokstäver, siffror och '-'. Om MQTT är aktiverat sätts även topic-namn, objekt-ID-prefix, HA-enhetsnamn och ID till detta.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Необов'язково: Ім'я хоста може містити лише літери, цифри та '-'. Якщо MQTT увімкнено, ім'я топіка, префікс Object ID, ім'я та ID пристрою HA також будуть встановлені на це значення.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_PASSWORD_MUST_8_63_CHARACTERS_LONG_PRINTABLE_ASCII_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Password must be 8-63 characters long, printable ASCII only</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Passwort muss 8-63 Zeichen lang sein, nur druckbares ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Salasanan on oltava 8-63 merkkiä pitkä, vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Le mot de passe doit faire 8 à 63 caractères, ASCII imprimable uniquement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A jelszónak 8-63 karakter hosszúnak kell lennie, csak nyomtatható ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wachtwoord moet 8-63 tekens lang zijn, alleen afdrukbare ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lösenordet måste vara 8-63 tecken långt, endast utskrivbar ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Пароль має містити 8-63 символи, лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_PERIODIC_BMS_RESET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Periodic BMS reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Periodischer BMS-Reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ajoittainen BMS-nollaus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réinitialisation périodique du BMS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Időszakos BMS-visszaállítás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Periodieke BMS-reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Periodisk BMS-återställning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Періодичне скидання BMS</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
