<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_POWER_LIMITING_BEGINS_WHEN_PACK_VOLTAGE_MANY_DV_ABOVE_DISCHARGE_VOLTAGE_LIMIT_DEFAULT_20_2_0V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Power limiting begins when pack voltage is this many dV above the discharge voltage limit (default 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Leistungsbegrenzung beginnt, wenn die Packspannung so viele dV über der Entladespannungsgrenze liegt (Standard 20 = 2,0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tehon rajoitus alkaa, kun akuston jännite on näin monta dV purkujänniterajan yläpuolella (oletus 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>La limitation de puissance commence quand la tension du pack dépasse la limite de tension de décharge de ce nombre de dV (défaut 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A teljesítménykorlátozás akkor kezdődik, amikor a pakkfeszültség ennyi dV-tal van a kisütési feszültséghatár felett (alapértelmezés 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vermogensbeperking begint wanneer de pakspanning dit aantal dV boven de ontlaadspanningslimiet ligt (standaard 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Effektbegränsningen börjar när packspänningen ligger så här många dV över urladdningsspänningsgränsen (standard 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Обмеження потужності починається, коли напруга батареї на стільки dV вища за межу напруги розряду (типово 20 = 2.0V)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_REPEAT_WEB_INTERFACE_PASSWORD</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Repeat the web interface password</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Webinterface-Passwort wiederholen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Toista verkkokäyttöliittymän salasana</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Répéter le mot de passe de l'interface web</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ismételje meg a webes felület jelszavát</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Herhaal het webinterface-wachtwoord</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Upprepa lösenordet för webbgränssnittet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Повторіть пароль веб-інтерфейсу</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_REQUIRE_HTTP_BASIC_AUTHENTICATION_WEB_INTERFACE_OTA_PAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Require HTTP Basic authentication for the web interface and OTA page</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HTTP-Basic-Authentifizierung für Webinterface und OTA-Seite verlangen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vaadi HTTP Basic -todennus verkkokäyttöliittymälle ja OTA-sivulle</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Exiger l'authentification HTTP Basic pour l'interface web et la page OTA</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HTTP Basic hitelesítés megkövetelése a webes felülethez és az OTA-oldalhoz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vereis HTTP Basic-authenticatie voor de webinterface en OTA-pagina</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kräv HTTP Basic-autentisering för webbgränssnittet och OTA-sidan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Вимагати автентифікацію HTTP Basic для веб-інтерфейсу та сторінки OTA</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SCALED_SOC_WHERE_CHARGE_POWER_TAPERING_BEGINS_95_FULL_POWER_UNTIL_95PCT_THEN_LINEAR_REDUCTION_REACHING_0W_AT_100PCT_LIMITED_50_85PCT_BATTERY_TYPES_WHERE_TAPERING_MANDATORY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Scaled SOC where charge power tapering begins. 95 = full power until 95pct, then linear reduction reaching 0W at 100pct. Limited to 50-85pct for battery types where tapering is mandatory.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Skalierter SOC, bei dem die Ladeleistungs-Absenkung beginnt. 95 = volle Leistung bis 95%, dann lineare Reduzierung bis 0W bei 100%. Auf 50-85% begrenzt für Batterietypen, bei denen die Absenkung obligatorisch ist.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Skaalattu SOC, jossa lataustehon pudotus alkaa. 95 = täysi teho 95pct asti, sitten lineaarinen vähennys, joka saavuttaa 0W 100pct kohdalla. Rajoitettu välille 50-85pct akkutyypeille, joilla pudotus on pakollinen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC mis à l'échelle où la réduction de la puissance de charge commence. 95 = pleine puissance jusqu'à 95pct, puis réduction linéaire atteignant 0W à 100pct. Limité à 50-85pct pour les types de batterie où la réduction est obligatoire.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Skálázott SOC, ahol a töltési teljesítmény leszabályozása kezdődik. 95 = teljes teljesítmény 95%-ig, majd lineáris csökkentés, 100%-nál 0W-ot elérve. 50-85%-ra korlátozva azoknál az akkumulátortípusoknál, ahol a leszabályozás kötelező.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Geschaalde SOC waar de afbouw van laadvermogen begint. 95 = vol vermogen tot 95pct, daarna lineaire reductie tot 0W bij 100pct. Beperkt tot 50-85pct voor batterijtypes waar afbouw verplicht is.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Skalad SOC där nedtrappning av laddeffekten börjar. 95 = full effekt till 95pct, därefter linjär minskning som når 0W vid 100pct. Begränsad till 50-85pct för batterityper där nedtrappning är obligatorisk.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Масштабований SOC, з якого починається зниження потужності заряду. 95 = повна потужність до 95pct, далі лінійне зниження до 0W при 100pct. Обмежено 50-85pct для типів батарей, де зниження обов'язкове.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SD_CARD</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD Card</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD-Karte</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD-kortti</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Carte µSD</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD-kártya</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD-kaart</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>µSD-kort</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Картка µSD</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SELECT_CAN_BUS_BAUDRATE_500KBPS_MOST_BATTERIES_250KBPS_SOME_CONFIGURATIONS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Select CAN bus baudrate (500kbps for most batteries, 250kbps for some configurations)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-Bus-Baudrate wählen (500kbps für die meisten Batterien, 250kbps für einige Konfigurationen)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valitse CAN-väylän nopeus (500kbps useimmille akuille, 250kbps joillekin kokoonpanoille)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sélectionner le débit du bus CAN (500kbps pour la plupart des batteries, 250kbps pour certaines configurations)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>CAN-busz sebesség kiválasztása (500kbps a legtöbb akkumulátorhoz, 250kbps egyes konfigurációkhoz)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Selecteer CAN-bus-baudrate (500kbps voor de meeste batterijen, 250kbps voor sommige configuraties)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Välj CAN-bussens baudrate (500kbps för de flesta batterier, 250kbps för vissa konfigurationer)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Виберіть швидкість шини CAN (500kbps для більшості батарей, 250kbps для деяких конфігурацій)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SELECT_IF_WE_SHOULD_SEND_0_1_CAN_MESSAGES_USEFUL_MULTI_BATTERY_SETUPS_ID_PROBLEMS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Select if we should send ###0 or ###1 CAN messages, useful for multi-battery setups or ID problems</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Auswählen, ob ###0- oder ###1-CAN-Nachrichten gesendet werden sollen, nützlich bei Multi-Batterie-Setups oder ID-Problemen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valitse, lähetetäänkö ###0- vai ###1-CAN-viestejä; hyödyllinen moniakkukokoonpanoissa tai ID-ongelmissa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sélectionner l'envoi de messages CAN ###0 ou ###1, utile pour les configurations multi-batteries ou les problèmes d'ID</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Válassza ki, hogy ###0 vagy ###1 CAN-üzeneteket küldjünk-e; hasznos többakkumulátoros beállításoknál vagy ID-problémáknál</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Selecteer of ###0- of ###1-CAN-berichten verzonden moeten worden, nuttig voor multi-batterij-opstellingen of ID-problemen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Välj om vi ska skicka ###0- eller ###1-CAN-meddelanden, användbart för flerbatterisystem eller ID-problem</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Виберіть, надсилати CAN-повідомлення ###0 чи ###1; корисно для систем з кількома батареями або проблем з ID</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SEND_GENERAL_LOGGING_AS_UDP_SYSLOG_DATAGRAMS_RFC_5424_REMOTE_SERVER_EVENTS_USE_THEIR_OWN_SEVERITY_OTHER_LINES_ARE_SENT_AS_DEBUG</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Send general logging as UDP syslog datagrams (RFC 5424) to a remote server. Events use their own severity; other lines are sent as debug.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Allgemeines Logging als UDP-Syslog-Datagramme (RFC 5424) an einen entfernten Server senden. Ereignisse verwenden ihre eigene Schwere; andere Zeilen werden als Debug gesendet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lähetä yleinen lokitus UDP-syslog-datagrammeina (RFC 5424) etäpalvelimelle. Tapahtumat käyttävät omaa vakavuustasoaan; muut rivit lähetetään debug-tasolla.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Envoyer la journalisation générale en datagrammes syslog UDP (RFC 5424) vers un serveur distant. Les événements utilisent leur propre sévérité; les autres lignes sont envoyées en debug.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Általános naplózás küldése UDP syslog datagramként (RFC 5424) távoli szerverre. Az események saját súlyosságukat használják; a többi sor debug szinten kerül elküldésre.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verstuur algemene logging als UDP-syslog-datagrammen (RFC 5424) naar een externe server. Gebeurtenissen gebruiken hun eigen ernst; andere regels worden als debug verzonden.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Skicka allmän loggning som UDP-syslog-datagram (RFC 5424) till en fjärrserver. Händelser använder sin egen allvarlighetsgrad; övriga rader skickas som debug.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Надсилати загальні журнали як датаграми UDP syslog (RFC 5424) на віддалений сервер. Події використовують власний рівень серйозності; інші рядки надсилаються як debug.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SET_PASSWORD_BEFORE_ENABLING_PASSWORD_PROTECTION_PRINTABLE_ASCII_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Set a password before enabling password protection. Printable ASCII only</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vor dem Aktivieren des Passwortschutzes ein Passwort festlegen. Nur druckbares ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aseta salasana ennen salasanasuojauksen käyttöönottoa. Vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Définir un mot de passe avant d'activer la protection par mot de passe. ASCII imprimable uniquement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Állítson be jelszót a jelszavas védelem engedélyezése előtt. Csak nyomtatható ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stel een wachtwoord in voordat u wachtwoordbeveiliging inschakelt. Alleen afdrukbare ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange ett lösenord innan lösenordsskydd aktiveras. Endast skrivbara ASCII-tecken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Встановіть пароль перед увімкненням захисту паролем. Лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_STATUS_LED_GPIO2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Status LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Status-LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tila-LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>LED d'état (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Állapotjelző LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Status-LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Status-LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Статусний LED (GPIO2)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_STORE_INCOMING_OUTGOING_CAN_MESSAGES_SD_CARD_ONLY_WORKS_HARDWARE_SD_CARD_SLOT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Store incoming/outgoing CAN messages on on SD card. Only works on hardware with SD-card slot.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Eingehende/ausgehende CAN-Nachrichten auf SD-Karte speichern. Funktioniert nur auf Hardware mit SD-Kartensteckplatz.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tallenna saapuvat/lähtevät CAN-viestit SD-kortille. Toimii vain laitteissa, joissa on SD-korttipaikka.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stocker les messages CAN entrants/sortants sur la carte SD. Ne fonctionne que sur le matériel avec lecteur de carte SD.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bejövő/kimenő CAN-üzenetek tárolása SD-kártyán. Csak SD-kártya-foglalattal rendelkező hardveren működik.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sla inkomende/uitgaande CAN-berichten op op SD-kaart. Werkt alleen op hardware met SD-kaartsleuf.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lagra inkommande/utgående CAN-meddelanden på SD-kort. Fungerar endast på hårdvara med SD-kortplats.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Зберігати вхідні/вихідні CAN-повідомлення на SD-картці. Працює лише на обладнанні зі слотом для SD-картки.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_STORE_LOGS_SD_CARD_ONLY_WORKS_HARDWARE_SD_CARD_SLOT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Store logs on an SD card. Only works on hardware with SD-card slot.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Logs auf einer SD-Karte speichern. Funktioniert nur auf Hardware mit SD-Kartensteckplatz.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tallenna lokit SD-kortille. Toimii vain laitteissa, joissa on SD-korttipaikka.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stocker les journaux sur une carte SD. Ne fonctionne que sur le matériel avec lecteur de carte SD.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Naplók tárolása SD-kártyán. Csak SD-kártya-foglalattal rendelkező hardveren működik.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sla logs op een SD-kaart op. Werkt alleen op hardware met SD-kaartsleuf.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lagra loggar på SD-kort. Fungerar endast på hårdvara med SD-kortplats.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Зберігати журнали на SD-картці. Працює лише на обладнанні зі слотом для SD-картки.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SUBNET_MASK_YOUR_NETWORK</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Subnet mask of your network</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Subnetzmaske Ihres Netzwerks</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verkkosi aliverkon peite</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Masque de sous-réseau de votre réseau</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A hálózat alhálózati maszkja</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Subnetmasker van uw netwerk</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nätverkets subnätmask</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Маска підмережі вашої мережі</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_SWITCH_ESTIMATED_STATE_CHARGE_WHEN_ACCURATE_SOC_DATA_NOT_AVAILABLE_FROM_BATTERY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Switch to estimated State of Charge when accurate SOC data is not available from the battery</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Auf geschätzten Ladezustand umschalten, wenn keine genauen SOC-Daten von der Batterie verfügbar sind</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Siirry arvioituun varaustilaan, kun tarkkaa SOC-tietoa ei ole saatavilla akusta</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Basculer vers l'état de charge estimé quand des données SOC précises ne sont pas disponibles depuis la batterie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Váltás becsült töltöttségi szintre, ha az akkumulátortól nem érhető el pontos SOC-adat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel over naar geschatte laadtoestand wanneer nauwkeurige SOC-data niet beschikbaar is van de batterij</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växla till uppskattad laddningsnivå när exakta SOC-data inte är tillgängliga från batteriet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Перемикатися на розрахунковий рівень заряду, коли точні дані SOC недоступні від батареї</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_TIMEOUT_MILLISECONDS_1_60000</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Timeout in milliseconds (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Timeout in Millisekunden (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aikakatkaisu millisekunteina (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Timeout en millisecondes (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Időtúllépés milliszekundumban (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Time-out in milliseconden (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Timeout i millisekunder (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тайм-аут у мілісекундах (1-60000)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_TIME_MILLISECONDS_PRECHARGE_SHOULD_ACTIVE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Time in milliseconds the precharge should be active</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zeit in Millisekunden, die die Vorladung aktiv sein soll</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aika millisekunteina, jonka esilatauksen tulee olla aktiivinen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Durée en millisecondes pendant laquelle la précharge doit être active</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az előtöltés aktív ideje milliszekundumban</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tijd in milliseconden dat de voorlading actief moet zijn</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tid i millisekunder som förladdningen ska vara aktiv</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Час у мілісекундах, протягом якого передзаряд має бути активним</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_TW_TAIWAN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taiwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taiwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taiwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taïwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Tajvan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taiwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Taiwan)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>TW (Тайвань)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_UDP_PORT_DEFAULT_514</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP port (default 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP-Port (Standard 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP-portti (oletus 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Port UDP (défaut 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP-port (alapértelmezés: 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP-poort (standaard 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UDP-port (standard 514)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Порт UDP (типово 514)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_UNRELIABLE_CPU_TEMPERATURE_READINGS_CAN_CORRECTED_OFFSET_MEASURE_ACTUAL_TEMPERATURE_SEPARATE_THERMOMETER_ADJUST_OFFSET_ACCORDINGLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Unreliable CPU temperature readings can be corrected with an offset. Measure the actual temperature with a separate thermometer and adjust the offset accordingly.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Unzuverlässige CPU-Temperaturmesswerte können mit einem Offset korrigiert werden. Die tatsächliche Temperatur mit einem separaten Thermometer messen und den Offset entsprechend anpassen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Epäluotettavat CPU-lämpötilalukemat voidaan korjata offset-arvolla. Mittaa todellinen lämpötila erillisellä lämpömittarilla ja säädä offset sen mukaan.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Des lectures de température CPU peu fiables peuvent être corrigées avec un décalage. Mesurez la température réelle avec un thermomètre séparé et ajustez le décalage en conséquence.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A megbízhatatlan CPU-hőmérséklet-értékek eltolással korrigálhatók. Mérje meg a tényleges hőmérsékletet külön hőmérővel, és állítsa be ennek megfelelően az eltolást.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Onbetrouwbare CPU-temperatuurmetingen kunnen met een offset worden gecorrigeerd. Meet de werkelijke temperatuur met een aparte thermometer en pas de offset daarop aan.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Otillförlitliga CPU-temperaturavläsningar kan korrigeras med en offset. Mät den verkliga temperaturen med en separat termometer och justera offseten därefter.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ненадійні показання температури CPU можна скоригувати зміщенням. Виміряйте фактичну температуру окремим термометром і відповідно налаштуйте зміщення.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_USE_LONGER_TIMEOUT_INVERTER_STILL_ALIVE_CAN_MESSAGES</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Use a longer timeout for inverter still alive CAN messages</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Längeren Timeout für „Wechselrichter noch aktiv“-CAN-Nachrichten verwenden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Käytä pidempää aikakatkaisua invertterin still alive -CAN-viesteille</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Utiliser un timeout plus long pour les messages CAN de présence de l'onduleur</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hosszabb időtúllépés használata az inverter életjel CAN-üzeneteihez</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gebruik een langere time-out voor still-alive-CAN-berichten van de omvormer</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Använd en längre timeout för växelriktarens still alive-CAN-meddelanden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Використовувати довший тайм-аут для CAN-повідомлень still alive від інвертора</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_US_USA</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (VS)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (USA)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>US (США)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_VOLTAGE_OFFSET_REQUIRED_CALIBRATE_0A_READING_1_AUTO_DETECT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voltage offset required to calibrate 0A reading. -1 = auto-detect</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Spannungsoffset zur Kalibrierung der 0A-Messung. -1 = automatische Erkennung</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jänniteoffset, jota tarvitaan 0A-lukeman kalibrointiin. -1 = automaattinen tunnistus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Décalage de tension requis pour calibrer la lecture 0A. -1 = détection automatique</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A 0A-s érték kalibrálásához szükséges feszültségeltolás. -1 = automatikus felismerés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Spanningsoffset nodig om de 0A-meting te kalibreren. -1 = autodetectie</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Spänningsoffset som krävs för att kalibrera 0A-avläsning. -1 = automatisk detektering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Зсув напруги, потрібний для калібрування показання 0A. -1 = автовизначення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WARNING_CAUSES_PERFORMANCE_ISSUES_LOG_GENERAL_MESSAGES_VIA_USB_CABLE_AVOID_IF_POSSIBLE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WARNING: Causes performance issues. Log general messages via USB cable. Avoid if possible!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WARNUNG: Verursacht Leistungsprobleme. Allgemeine Meldungen über USB-Kabel loggen. Nach Möglichkeit vermeiden!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>VAROITUS: Aiheuttaa suorituskykyongelmia. Kirjaa yleiset viestit USB-kaapelin kautta. Vältä jos mahdollista!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ATTENTION: Cause des problèmes de performance. Journaliser les messages généraux via câble USB. À éviter si possible!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>FIGYELEM: Teljesítményproblémákat okoz. Általános üzenetek naplózása USB-kábelen keresztül. Lehetőleg kerülje!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WAARSCHUWING: veroorzaakt prestatieproblemen. Log algemene berichten via USB-kabel. Vermijd indien mogelijk!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>VARNING: Orsakar prestandaproblem. Logga allmänna meddelanden via USB-kabel. Undvik om möjligt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>УВАГА: Спричиняє проблеми з продуктивністю. Логування загальних повідомлень через USB-кабель. Уникайте, якщо можливо!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WARNING_CAUSES_PERFORMANCE_ISSUES_LOG_INCOMING_OUTGOING_CAN_MESSAGES_VIA_USB_CABLE_AVOID_IF_POSSIBLE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WARNING: Causes performance issues! Log incoming/outgoing CAN messages via USB cable. Avoid if possible!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WARNUNG: Verursacht Leistungsprobleme! Eingehende/ausgehende CAN-Nachrichten über USB-Kabel loggen. Nach Möglichkeit vermeiden!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>VAROITUS: Aiheuttaa suorituskykyongelmia! Kirjaa saapuvat/lähtevät CAN-viestit USB-kaapelin kautta. Vältä jos mahdollista!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>ATTENTION: Cause des problèmes de performance! Journaliser les messages CAN entrants/sortants via câble USB. À éviter si possible!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>FIGYELEM: Teljesítményproblémákat okoz! Bejövő/kimenő CAN-üzenetek naplózása USB-kábelen keresztül. Lehetőleg kerülje!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WAARSCHUWING: veroorzaakt prestatieproblemen! Log inkomende/uitgaande CAN-berichten via USB-kabel. Vermijd indien mogelijk!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>VARNING: Orsakar prestandaproblem! Logga inkommande/utgående CAN-meddelanden via USB-kabel. Undvik om möjligt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>УВАГА: Спричиняє проблеми з продуктивністю! Логування вхідних/вихідних CAN-повідомлень через USB-кабель. Уникайте, якщо можливо!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WEB_INTERFACE_USERNAME_PRINTABLE_ASCII_ONLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Web interface username, printable ASCII only</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Webinterface-Benutzername, nur druckbares ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Web-käyttöliittymän käyttäjätunnus, vain tulostettavia ASCII-merkkejä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nom d'utilisateur de l'interface web, ASCII imprimable uniquement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Webes felület felhasználóneve, csak nyomtatható ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Webinterface-gebruikersnaam, alleen afdrukbare ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Användarnamn för webbgränssnittet, endast utskrivbar ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ім'я користувача веб-інтерфейсу, лише друковані символи ASCII</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WHEN_ENABLED_30K_OFFSET_WILL_APPLIED_SOME_SIGNALS_USEFUL_SOME_INVERTERS_SEE_WRONG_DATA_OTHERWISE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>When enabled, 30k offset will be applied on some signals, useful for some inverters that see wrong data otherwise</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wenn aktiviert, wird auf einige Signale ein 30k-Offset angewendet, nützlich für einige Wechselrichter, die sonst falsche Daten sehen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kun käytössä, joihinkin signaaleihin lisätään 30k-offset, hyödyllinen joillekin inverttereille, jotka muuten näkevät väärää dataa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Si activé, un décalage de 30k sera appliqué sur certains signaux, utile pour certains onduleurs qui voient sinon des données erronées</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ha engedélyezve van, 30k eltolás kerül alkalmazásra egyes jeleken; hasznos egyes invertereknél, amelyek egyébként hibás adatokat látnak</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Indien ingeschakeld wordt op sommige signalen een 30k-offset toegepast, nuttig voor sommige omvormers die anders verkeerde data zien</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>När aktiverad tillämpas 30k-offset på vissa signaler, användbart för vissa växelriktare som annars ser felaktiga data</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Якщо увімкнено, до деяких сигналів застосовується зсув 30k, корисно для деяких інверторів, які інакше бачать неправильні дані</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WHEN_ENABLED_BYTEORDER_WILL_INVERTED_SOME_SIGNALS_USEFUL_SOME_INVERTERS_SEE_WRONG_DATA_OTHERWISE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>When enabled, byteorder will be inverted on some signals, useful for some inverters that see wrong data otherwise</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wenn aktiviert, wird die Bytereihenfolge einiger Signale invertiert, nützlich für einige Wechselrichter, die sonst falsche Daten sehen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kun käytössä, joidenkin signaalien tavujärjestys käännetään, hyödyllinen joillekin inverttereille, jotka muuten näkevät väärää dataa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Si activé, l'ordre des octets sera inversé sur certains signaux, utile pour certains onduleurs qui voient sinon des données erronées</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ha engedélyezve van, a bájtsorrend invertálva lesz egyes jeleken; hasznos egyes invertereknél, amelyek egyébként hibás adatokat látnak</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Indien ingeschakeld wordt de bytevolgorde op sommige signalen geïnverteerd, nuttig voor sommige omvormers die anders verkeerde data zien</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>När aktiverad inverteras byteordningen på vissa signaler, användbart för vissa växelriktare som annars ser felaktiga data</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Якщо увімкнено, порядок байтів деяких сигналів інвертується, корисно для деяких інверторів, які інакше бачать неправильні дані</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SET_WUP1_WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>WUP1 / WUP2</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
