<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ADVANCED_DETAILED_INFO_CURRENTLY_LIMITED_MAIN_BATTERY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Advanced detailed info is currently limited to the Main Battery.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Erweiterte Detailinformationen sind derzeit auf die Hauptbatterie beschränkt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Tarkemmat lisätiedot ovat toistaiseksi saatavilla vain pääakulle.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Les infos détaillées avancées sont actuellement limitées à la batterie principale.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ A speciális részletes információk jelenleg csak a fő akkumulátorra érhetők el.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Geavanceerde detailinformatie is momenteel beperkt tot de hoofdbatterij.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Avancerad detaljerad info är för närvarande begränsad till huvudbatteriet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>⚠️ Розширена детальна інформація наразі доступна лише для головної батареї.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ALERT_ERROR_XHR_RESPONSETEXT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ALERT_INVALID_VALUE_PLEASE_ENTER_VALUE_BETWEEN_0_65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invalid value. Please enter a value between 0 and 65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ungültiger Wert. Bitte einen Wert zwischen 0 und 65535 eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virheellinen arvo. Anna arvo väliltä 0-65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valeur invalide. Veuillez entrer une valeur entre 0 et 65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Érvénytelen érték. Adjon meg egy értéket 0 és 65535 között</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ongeldige waarde. Voer een waarde in tussen 0 en 65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ogiltigt värde. Ange ett värde mellan 0 och 65535</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Некоректне значення. Введіть значення від 0 до 65535</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ALERT_SUCCESS_XHR_RESPONSETEXT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Success:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erfolg:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Onnistui:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Succès:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Siker:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Succes:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lyckades:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Успішно:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_AMOUNT_OF_CELLS_UNKNOWN_CELLVOLTAGES_NOT_YET_READ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Amount of cells unknown. Cellvoltages not yet read</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anzahl der Zellen unbekannt. Zellspannungen noch nicht ausgelesen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kennojen määrä tuntematon. Kennojännitteitä ei ole vielä luettu</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nombre de cellules inconnu. Tensions de cellule pas encore lues</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A cellák száma ismeretlen. A cellafeszültségek még nem lettek beolvasva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aantal cellen onbekend. Celspanningen nog niet uitgelezen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Antal celler okänt. Cellspänningar har inte lästs ännu</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Кількість елементів невідома. Напруги елементів ще не зчитані</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_AMOUNT_OF_SECONDS_BMS_POWER_SHOULD_BE_OFF_DURING_PERIODIC_DAILY_RESETS_REQUIRES_PERIODIC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Amount of seconds BMS power should be off during periodic daily resets. Requires "Periodic BMS reset" to be enabled. Enter value in seconds (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anzahl der Sekunden, die die BMS-Versorgung bei periodischen täglichen Neustarts ausgeschaltet sein soll. Erfordert, dass "Periodischer BMS-Reset" aktiviert ist. Wert in Sekunden eingeben (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sekuntien määrä, jonka BMS:n virta on pois päivittäisten jaksoittaisten nollauksien aikana. Edellyttää, että "Jaksoittainen BMS-nollaus" on käytössä. Anna arvo sekunneissa (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Durée en secondes pendant laquelle le BMS doit être hors tension lors des réinitialisations quotidiennes périodiques. Nécessite que "Periodic BMS reset" soit activé. Saisir la valeur en secondes (1-59) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hány másodpercig legyen kikapcsolva a BMS tápellátása a periodikus napi visszaállítások során. A "Periodikus BMS visszaállítás" engedélyezése szükséges. Adja meg az értéket másodpercekben (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aantal seconden dat de BMS-voeding uit moet zijn tijdens periodieke dagelijkse resets. Vereist dat "Periodieke BMS-reset" is ingeschakeld. Voer waarde in seconden in (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Antal sekunder BMS-strömmen ska vara av vid periodiska dagliga omstarter. Kräver att "Periodisk BMS-återstart" är aktiverat. Ange värde i sekunder (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Кількість секунд, протягом яких живлення BMS повинно бути вимкнено під час щоденних циклічних скидань. Вимагає увімкнення «Циклічного скидання BMS». Введіть значення в секундах (1-59):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_AN_ERROR_OCCURRED_WHILE_TRYING_TO_RESET_THE_DEVICE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>An error occurred while trying to reset the device.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Beim Zurücksetzen des Geräts ist ein Fehler aufgetreten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laitteen palautuksen aikana tapahtui virhe.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Une erreur s'est produite lors de la tentative de réinitialisation de l'appareil.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba történt az eszköz visszaállítása közben.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Er is een fout opgetreden bij het herstellen van de fabrieksinstellingen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ett fel uppstod vid försök att återställa enheten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Під час спроби скинути пристрій сталася помилка.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_APPLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Apply</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Übernehmen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Käytä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Appliquer</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Alkalmaz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Toepassen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verkställ</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Застосувати</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ARE_YOU_SURE_YOU_WANT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sind Sie sicher, dass Sie Folgendes möchten: {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan szeretné: {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u dit wilt: {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill {0}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете {0}</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ARE_YOU_SURE_YOU_WANT_CLEAR_ALL_EVENTS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to clear all events?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Möchten Sie wirklich alle Ereignisse löschen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti tyhjentää kaikki tapahtumat?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voulez-vous vraiment effacer tous les événements?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan törli az összes eseményt?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u alle gebeurtenissen wilt wissen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill rensa alla händelser?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете очистити всі події?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ARE_YOU_SURE_YOU_WANT_TO_RESET_THE_DEVICE_TO_FACTORY_SETTINGS_THIS_WILL_ERASE_ALL_SETTIN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to reset the device to factory settings? This will erase all settings and data.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gerät wirklich auf Werkseinstellungen zurücksetzen? Alle Einstellungen und Daten werden gelöscht.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti palauttaa laitteen tehdasasetuksiin? Kaikki asetukset ja tiedot poistetaan.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir réinitialiser l'appareil aux paramètres d'usine ? Cela effacera tous les paramètres et données.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan vissza szeretné állítani az eszközt a gyári beállításokra? Ez törli az összes beállítást és adatot.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u het apparaat wilt terugzetten naar fabrieksinstellingen? Dit zal alle instellingen en gegevens wissen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill återställa enheten till fabriksinställningar? Detta raderar alla inställningar och data.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете скинути пристрій до заводських налаштувань? Це видалить усі налаштування та дані.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BACK_MAIN_PAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Back to main page</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Zurück zur Hauptseite</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Takaisin pääsivulle</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Retour à la page principale</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vissza a főoldalra</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Terug naar hoofdpagina</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tillbaka till huvudsidan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Назад на головну сторінку</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BALANCING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balancing</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansointi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Équilibrage</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kiegyenlítés</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balanceren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Balansering</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Балансування</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BALANCING_IT_OFTEN_TAKES_MANY_HOURS_THERE_WILL_NO_PROGRESS_INDICATION</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>continue? Please charge battery fully for this to work. After a couple of minutes, battery will sleep and do balancing. It often takes many hours. There will be no progress indication.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>fortfahren? Laden Sie die Batterie dafür vollständig auf. Nach einigen Minuten geht die Batterie in den Ruhezustand und führt das Balancing durch. Es dauert oft viele Stunden. Es gibt keine Fortschrittsanzeige.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>jatkaa? Lataa akku täyteen, jotta tämä toimii. Muutaman minuutin kuluttua akku siirtyy lepotilaan ja aloittaa balansoinnin. Se kestää usein monta tuntia. Edistymistä ei näytetä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>continuer ? Chargez complètement la batterie pour que cela fonctionne. Après quelques minutes, la batterie se met en veille et effectue l'équilibrage. Cela prend souvent de nombreuses heures. Il n'y aura aucune indication de progression.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>folytatja? A működéshez töltse fel teljesen az akkumulátort. Néhány perc múlva az akkumulátor alvó állapotba kerül és elvégzi a kiegyenlítést. Ez gyakran sok órát vesz igénybe. Nem lesz folyamatjelzés.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>doorgaan? Laad de batterij volledig op om dit te laten werken. Na een paar minuten gaat de batterij in slaapstand en begint met balanceren. Dit duurt vaak vele uren. Er is geen voortgangsindicatie.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>fortsätta? Ladda batteriet fullt för att detta ska fungera. Efter ett par minuter somnar batteriet och utför balansering. Det tar ofta många timmar. Ingen förloppsindikering visas.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>продовжити? Повністю зарядіть батарею, щоб це спрацювало. Через кілька хвилин батарея перейде в режим сну і почне балансування. Це часто триває багато годин. Індикація прогресу відсутня.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_BMS_STATUS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery BMS status:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie-BMS-Status:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun BMS-tila:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>État BMS de la batterie:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkumulátor BMS állapota:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij BMS-status:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriets BMS-status:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Статус BMS батареї:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_CHARGING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery charging!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie lädt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku latautuu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie en charge!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkumulátor töltése!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij laadt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet laddas!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея заряджається!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_DISCHARGING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery discharging!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie entlädt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku purkautuu!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie en décharge!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkumulátor kisütése!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij ontlaadt!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriet laddas ur!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея розряджається!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_EMULATOR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery Emulator</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_IDLE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery idle</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie im Leerlauf</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akku joutilaana</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterie inactive</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkumulátor tétlen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterij inactief</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteri i vila</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Батарея в очікуванні</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_PACK_MAX_VOLTAGE_TEMPORARILY_RAISED_TO_THIS_VALUE_DURING_FORCED_BALANCING_VALUE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery pack max voltage temporarily raised to this value during forced balancing. Value in V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale Spannung des Batteriepacks wird während des erzwungenen Balancings vorübergehend auf diesen Wert angehoben. Wert in V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkupaketin enimmäisjännite nostetaan tilapäisesti tähän arvoon pakkobalansoinnin aikana. Arvo V:ssa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tension maximale du pack de batteries temporairement augmentée à cette valeur pendant l'équilibrage forcé. Valeur en V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az akkumulátorcsomag maximális feszültsége ideiglenesen erre az értékre emelkedik kényszerített kiegyensúlyozás során. Érték V-ban</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Maximale spanning van het batterijpack tijdelijk verhoogd tot deze waarde tijdens geforceerde balancering. Waarde in V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteripackets maxspänning höjs tillfälligt till detta värde under tvingad balansering. Värde i V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Максимальна напруга акумуляторного пакета тимчасово підвищується до цього значення під час примусового балансування. Значення в V</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BATTERY_PROTOCOL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Battery protocol:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterieprotokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkuprotokolla:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Protocole batterie:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akkumulátor-protokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batterijprotocol:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Batteriprotokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Протокол батареї:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_BMS_RESET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS Reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-Reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS:n nollaus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réinitialisation BMS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS visszaállítás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>BMS-återställning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скидання BMS</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
