<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CLICK_BROWSE_SELECT_TXT_CANDUMP_LOG_FILE_UPLOAD</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Click Browse to select a .txt CANdump log file to upload</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Auf „Durchsuchen“ klicken, um eine .txt-CANdump-Logdatei zum Hochladen auszuwählen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valitse ladattava .txt CANdump-lokitiedosto napsauttamalla Selaa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cliquez sur Parcourir pour sélectionner un fichier journal CANdump .txt à téléverser</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kattintson a Tallózás gombra egy .txt CANdump naplófájl feltöltéséhez</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Klik op Bladeren om een .txt CANdump-logbestand te selecteren om te uploaden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Klicka på Bläddra för att välja en .txt CANdump-loggfil att ladda upp</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Натисніть «Огляд», щоб вибрати .txt-файл журналу CANdump для завантаження</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CLOSE_CONTACTORS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Close Contactors</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schütze schließen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sulje kontaktorit</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fermer les contacteurs</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mágneskapcsolók zárása</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Contactoren sluiten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Stäng kontaktorer</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Замкнути контактори</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_COMMAND_PERFORMED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Command performed.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Befehl ausgeführt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Komento suoritettu.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Commande exécutée.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Parancs végrehajtva.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Commando uitgevoerd.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kommando utfört.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Команду виконано.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_COMPLETED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Completed</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Abgeschlossen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valmis</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Terminé</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kész</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voltooid</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Klar</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Завершено</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONFIRM_CLEAR_ALL_EVENTS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to clear all events?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sollen wirklich alle Ereignisse gelöscht werden?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti tyhjentää kaikki tapahtumat?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir effacer tous les événements ?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan törli az összes eseményt?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u alle gebeurtenissen wilt wissen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill rensa alla händelser?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете очистити всі події?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONFIRM_OPEN_CONTACTORS_ON_BATTERY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>This action will attempt to open contactors on the battery. Are you sure?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Diese Aktion versucht, die Schütze der Batterie zu öffnen. Sind Sie sicher?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tämä toiminto yrittää avata akun kontaktorit. Oletko varma?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cette action tentera d'ouvrir les contacteurs de la batterie. Êtes-vous sûr ?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ez a művelet megkísérli kinyitni az akkumulátor kontaktorait. Biztosan folytatja?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Deze actie zal proberen de contactors van de accu te openen. Weet u het zeker?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Den här åtgärden kommer att försöka öppna kontaktorerna på batteriet. Är du säker?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ця дія спробує розімкнути контактори батареї. Ви впевнені?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONFIRM_PAUSE_CHARGE_DISCHARGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to pause charging and discharging? This will set the maximum charge and discharge values to zero, preventing any further power flow.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sollen Laden und Entladen wirklich pausiert werden? Dadurch werden die maximalen Lade- und Entladewerte auf null gesetzt, wodurch jeglicher weiterer Leistungsfluss verhindert wird.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti keskeyttää latauksen ja purkauksen? Tämä asettaa latauksen ja purkauksen enimmäisarvot nollaan, estäen kaiken tehonsiirron.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir interrompre la charge et la décharge ? Cela mettra à zéro les valeurs maximales de charge et de décharge, empêchant tout flux de puissance ultérieur.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan szünetelteti a töltést és a kisütést? Ez a maximális töltési és kisütési értékeket nullára állítja, megakadályozva minden további teljesítményáramlást.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u het laden en ontladen wilt onderbreken? Dit stelt de maximale laad- en ontlaadwaarden in op nul, waardoor verdere vermogensstroom wordt voorkomen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill pausa laddning och urladdning? Detta sätter de maximala laddnings- och urladdningsvärdena till noll, vilket förhindrar ytterligare effektflöde.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете призупинити заряджання та розряджання? Це встановить максимальні значення заряду та розряду на нуль, запобігаючи будь-якому подальшому потоку потужності.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONFIRM_REBOOT_EMULATOR_CONTACTORS_OPEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you sure you want to reboot the emulator? NOTE: If emulator is handling contactors, they will open during reboot!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Soll der Emulator wirklich neu gestartet werden? HINWEIS: Wenn der Emulator die Schütze steuert, werden diese während des Neustarts geöffnet!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haluatko varmasti käynnistää emulaattorin uudelleen? HUOM: Jos emulaattori ohjaa kontaktoreita, ne avautuvat uudelleenkäynnistyksen aikana!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir redémarrer l'émulateur ? REMARQUE : si l'émulateur gère des contacteurs, ils s'ouvriront pendant le redémarrage !</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Biztosan újraindítja az emulátort? MEGJEGYZÉS: Ha az emulátor kezeli a kontaktorokat, azok újraindítás közben kinyílnak!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weet u zeker dat u de emulator opnieuw wilt opstarten? LET OP: Als de emulator de contactors aanstuurt, zullen deze openen tijdens het opnieuw opstarten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Är du säker på att du vill starta om emulatorn? OBS: Om emulatorn hanterar kontaktorer kommer de att öppnas under omstarten!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ви впевнені, що хочете перезавантажити емулятор? ПРИМІТКА: Якщо емулятор керує контакторами, вони розімкнуться під час перезавантаження!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONNECTED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Connected</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbunden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhdistetty</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Connecté</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Csatlakozva</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbonden</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ansluten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Підключено</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONNECTION_LOST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Connection lost</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbindung verloren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhteys katkesi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Connexion perdue</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kapcsolat megszakadt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbinding verbroken</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anslutning förlorad</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>З'єднання втрачено</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_CONNECT_FAILED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Connect failed</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbindung fehlgeschlagen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yhdistäminen epäonnistui</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de connexion</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Csatlakozás sikertelen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verbinden mislukt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anslutning misslyckades</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Не вдалося підключитися</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
