<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EMULATOR_ALLOWS_CONTACTOR_CLOSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator allows contactor closing:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator erlaubt Schützschließen:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulaattori sallii kontaktorien sulkemisen:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'émulateur autorise la fermeture des contacteurs:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az emulátor engedélyezi a mágneskapcsolók zárását:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator staat contactorsluiting toe:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulatorn tillåter kontaktorstängning:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Емулятор дозволяє замикання контакторів:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EMULATOR_SPENT_TOO_MUCH_TIME_CRITICAL_FAULT_EVENT_INVESTIGATE_EVENT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator spent too much time in critical FAULT event. Investigate event</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator hat zu viel Zeit im kritischen FAULT-Ereignis verbracht. Ereignis untersuchen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulaattori vietti liian kauan kriittisessä FAULT-tapahtumassa. Tutki tapahtuma</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'émulateur a passé trop de temps en événement FAULT critique. Examinez l'événement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az emulátor túl sok időt töltött kritikus FAULT eseményben. Vizsgálja ki az eseményt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulator te lang in kritieke FAULT-gebeurtenis. Onderzoek de gebeurtenis</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Emulatorn tillbringade för lång tid i kritisk FAULT-händelse. Undersök händelsen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Емулятор надто довго перебував у критичній події FAULT. Дослідіть подію</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENABLE_OR_DISABLE_FORCED_LFP_BALANCING_MAKES_THE_BATTERY_CHARGE_TO_101PERCENT_THIS_SHOUL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable or disable forced LFP balancing. Makes the battery charge to 101percent. This should be performed once every month, to keep LFP batteries balanced. Ensure battery is fully charged before enabling, and also that you have enough sun or grid power to feed power into the battery while balancing is active. Enter 1 for enabled, 0 for disabled</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erzwungenes LFP-Balancing aktivieren oder deaktivieren. Lädt die Batterie auf 101percent. Sollte einmal im Monat durchgeführt werden, um LFP-Batterien balanciert zu halten. Sicherstellen, dass die Batterie vor der Aktivierung vollständig geladen ist und ausreichend Sonnen- oder Netzstrom vorhanden ist, um die Batterie während des aktiven Balancings zu versorgen. 1 für aktiviert, 0 für deaktiviert eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota pakkobalansointi käyttöön tai poista se käytöstä. Lataa akun 101percent:iin. Tämä tulisi suorittaa kerran kuukaudessa LFP-akkujen tasapainon ylläpitämiseksi. Varmista, että akku on täyteen ladattu ennen käyttöönottoa, ja että sinulla on riittävästi aurinko- tai verkkosähköä akun lataamiseksi balansoinnin aikana. Anna 1 käyttöönottamiseksi, 0 poistamiseksi käytöstä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer ou désactiver l'équilibrage LFP forcé. Fait charger la batterie à 101percent. Cette opération doit être effectuée une fois par mois pour maintenir l'équilibre des batteries LFP. S'assurer que la batterie est pleinement chargée avant d'activer, et que vous disposez de suffisamment d'énergie solaire ou réseau pour alimenter la batterie pendant que l'équilibrage est actif. Saisir 1 pour activer, 0 pour désactiver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A kényszerített LFP kiegyensúlyozás engedélyezése vagy letiltása. Az akkumulátort 101percent töltöttségre tölti. Ezt havonta egyszer kell elvégezni az LFP akkumulátorok kiegyensúlyozottságának fenntartása érdekében. Győződjön meg arról, hogy az akkumulátor teljesen feltöltött az engedélyezés előtt, és hogy elegendő nap- vagy hálózati energia áll rendelkezésre az akkumulátor táplálásához, amíg a kiegyensúlyozás aktív. Adja meg az 1-et az engedélyezéshez, 0-t a letiltáshoz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel geforceerde LFP-balancering in of uit. Laadt de batterij op tot 101percent. Dit moet eenmaal per maand worden uitgevoerd om LFP-batterijen gebalanceerd te houden. Zorg ervoor dat de batterij volledig geladen is voordat u dit inschakelt, en dat u voldoende zon- of netvermogen beschikbaar heeft om de batterij van stroom te voorzien terwijl balancering actief is. Voer 1 in voor ingeschakeld, 0 voor uitgeschakeld</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera eller inaktivera tvingad LFP-balansering. Laddar batteriet till 101percent. Bör utföras en gång per månad för att hålla LFP-batterier balanserade. Se till att batteriet är fulladdat innan aktivering, och att det finns tillräcklig sol- eller näteffekt för att mata energi in i batteriet medan balansering pågår. Ange 1 för aktiverat, 0 för inaktiverat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть або вимкніть примусове балансування LFP. Заряджає батарею до 101percent. Це слід виконувати раз на місяць для підтримки балансування LFP-батарей. Переконайтеся, що батарея повністю заряджена перед увімкненням, а також що у вас достатньо сонячної або мережевої потужності для подачі енергії в батарею під час активного балансування. Введіть 1 для увімкнення, 0 для вимкнення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENABLE_OR_DISABLE_HV_DC_OUTPUT_ENTER_1_FOR_ENABLED_0_FOR_DISABLED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable or disable HV DC output. Enter 1 for enabled, 0 for disabled</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>HV DC-Ausgang aktivieren oder deaktivieren. 1 für aktiviert, 0 für deaktiviert eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota HV DC -ulostulo käyttöön tai poista se käytöstä. Anna 1 käyttöönottamiseksi, 0 poistamiseksi käytöstä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer ou désactiver la sortie DC HV. Saisir 1 pour activer, 0 pour désactiver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A HV DC kimenet engedélyezése vagy letiltása. Adja meg az 1-et az engedélyezéshez, 0-t a letiltáshoz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel HV DC-uitgang in of uit. Voer 1 in voor ingeschakeld, 0 voor uitgeschakeld</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera eller inaktivera HV DC-utgång. Ange 1 för aktiverat, 0 för inaktiverat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть або вимкніть вихід HV DC. Введіть 1 для увімкнення, 0 для вимкнення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENABLE_OR_DISABLE_LOW_VOLTAGE_12V_AUXILIARY_DC_OUTPUT_ENTER_1_FOR_ENABLED_0_FOR_DISABLED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable or disable low voltage 12v auxiliary DC output. Enter 1 for enabled, 0 for disabled</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Niederspannungs-12V-Hilfs-DC-Ausgang aktivieren oder deaktivieren. 1 für aktiviert, 0 für deaktiviert eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota pienjännitteinen 12v apu-DC-ulostulo käyttöön tai poista se käytöstä. Anna 1 käyttöönottamiseksi, 0 poistamiseksi käytöstä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer ou désactiver la sortie DC auxiliaire basse tension 12v. Saisir 1 pour activer, 0 pour désactiver</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az alacsony feszültségű 12v kiegészítő DC kimenet engedélyezése vagy letiltása. Adja meg az 1-et az engedélyezéshez, 0-t a letiltáshoz</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel laagspanning 12v hulp-DC-uitgang in of uit. Voer 1 in voor ingeschakeld, 0 voor uitgeschakeld</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera eller inaktivera lågspännings 12V DC-hjälputgång. Ange 1 för aktiverat, 0 för inaktiverat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть або вимкніть допоміжний DC вихід низької напруги 12v. Введіть 1 для увімкнення, 0 для вимкнення</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENABLE_THIS_OPTION_TO_MANUALLY_RESTRICT_CHARGE_DISCHARGE_TO_A_SPECIFIC_VOLTAGE_SET_BELOW</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enable this option to manually restrict charge/discharge to a specific voltage set below. If disabled the emulator automatically determines this based on battery limits. Restrict manually? (0 = No, 1 = Yes):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Diese Option aktivieren, um Laden/Entladen manuell auf eine unten festgelegte Spannung zu begrenzen. Wenn deaktiviert, bestimmt der Emulator dies automatisch anhand der Batteriegrenzwerte. Manuell begrenzen? (0 = Nein, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ota tämä asetus käyttöön rajoittaaksesi latauksen/purkauksen alla asetettuun tiettyyn jännitteeseen manuaalisesti. Jos poistettu käytöstä, emulaattori määrittää tämän automaattisesti akkujen rajojen perusteella. Rajoitetaanko manuaalisesti? (0 = Ei, 1 = Kyllä):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Activer cette option pour limiter manuellement la charge/décharge à une tension spécifique définie ci-dessous. Si désactivé, l'émulateur détermine automatiquement cela en fonction des limites de la batterie. Restreindre manuellement ? (0 = Non, 1 = Oui) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engedélyezze ezt az opciót a töltési/kisütési feszültség manuális korlátozásához az alábbi megadott értékre. Ha letiltja, az emulátor automatikusan határozza meg ezt az akkumulátor határértékei alapján. Manuálisan korlátozza? (0 = Nem, 1 = Igen):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schakel deze optie in om laden/ontladen handmatig te beperken tot een specifieke spanning die hieronder is ingesteld. Als uitgeschakeld bepaalt de emulator dit automatisch op basis van de batterijgrenzen. Handmatig beperken? (0 = Nee, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Aktivera detta alternativ för att manuellt begränsa laddning/urladdning till en specifik spänning angiven nedan. Om inaktiverat bestämmer emulatorn detta automatiskt utifrån batteriets gränsvärden. Begränsa manuellt? (0 = Nej, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Увімкніть цю опцію, щоб вручну обмежити заряд/розряд до певної напруги, встановленої нижче. Якщо вимкнено, емулятор автоматично визначає це на основі обмежень батареї. Обмежити вручну? (0 = Ні, 1 = Так):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_END_OFFLINE_BALANCING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>end offline balancing?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Offline-Balancing beenden?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>lopettaa offline-balansoinnin?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>terminer l'équilibrage hors ligne?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>befejezi az offline kiegyenlítést?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>offline balanceren beëindigen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>avsluta offline-balansering?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>завершити офлайн-балансування?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENGLISH_BUILT_IN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>English (built-in)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Englisch (integriert)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Englanti (sisäänrakennettu)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anglais (intégré)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Angol (beépített)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engels (ingebouwd)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Engelska (inbyggd)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Англійська (вбудована)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENTER_CALIBRATION_TARGET_AH</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enter calibration target AH:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kalibrierungs-Ziel-AH eingeben:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anna kalibroinnin kohde-AH:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saisir la cible de calibration en AH :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adja meg a kalibrációs célértéket AH-ban:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voer kalibratiedoel-AH in:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange kalibreringens mål-AH:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Введіть цільове значення AH для калібрування:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENTER_CALIBRATION_TARGET_SOC_0_TO_100</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enter calibration target SOC (0 to 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kalibrierungs-Ziel-SOC eingeben (0 bis 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anna kalibroinnin kohde-SOC (0 to 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saisir le SOC cible de calibration (0 à 100) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adja meg a kalibrációs célértéket SOC-ban (0 to 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voer kalibratiedoel-SOC in (0 tot 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange kalibreringens mål-SOC (0 till 100):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Введіть цільове значення SOC для калібрування (0 до 100):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENTER_NEW_FAKE_BATTERY_VOLTAGE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enter new fake battery voltage</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Neue simulierte Batteriespannung eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anna uusi keinotekoinen akkujännite</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saisir la nouvelle tension de batterie simulée</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adja meg az új szimulált akkumulátorfeszültséget</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voer nieuwe nep-batterijspanning in</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange ny falsk batterispänning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Введіть нове фіктивне значення напруги батареї</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENTER_NEW_MAX_BALANCING_TIME_IN_MINUTES</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enter new max balancing time in minutes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Neue maximale Balancing-Dauer in Minuten eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anna uusi enimmäisbalansointiaika minuuteissa</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saisir le nouveau temps d'équilibrage maximum en minutes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adja meg az új maximális kiegyensúlyozási időt percekben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voer nieuwe maximale balanseringstijd in minuten in</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange ny maximal balanseringstid i minuter</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Введіть новий максимальний час балансування в хвилинах</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ENTER_NEW_MAX_BALANCING_TIME_MINUTES_1_300_NOTE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Enter new max balancing time in minutes (1-300). Note: not saved across reboot for now - resets to the 5h default on restart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Neuen maximalen Balancing-Zeitraum in Minuten eingeben (1-300). Hinweis: wird derzeit nicht über einen Neustart hinweg gespeichert – wird beim Neustart auf den 5h-Standardwert zurückgesetzt.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Anna uusi enimmäistasausaika minuutteina (1-300). Huom: ei säily uudelleenkäynnistyksen yli toistaiseksi – palautuu 5h oletusarvoon käynnistyksen yhteydessä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Entrez le nouveau temps d'équilibrage maximal en minutes (1-300). Remarque : non sauvegardé entre les redémarrages pour l'instant — réinitialisé à la valeur par défaut de 5h au redémarrage.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Adja meg az új maximális kiegyenlítési időt percben (1-300). Megjegyzés: jelenleg nem kerül mentésre újraindítás után – újraindításkor visszaáll az 5h alapértelmezett értékre.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voer de nieuwe maximale balanceringstijd in minuten in (1-300). Let op: wordt momenteel niet opgeslagen bij herstart - herstelt naar de standaard van 5h bij opnieuw opstarten.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ange ny maximal balanseringstid i minuter (1-300). Obs: sparas inte över omstart för tillfället - återställs till standardvärdet 5h vid omstart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Введіть новий максимальний час балансування в хвилинах (1-300). Примітка: наразі не зберігається між перезавантаженнями — скидається до стандартного значення 5h після перезапуску.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ERASE_DTC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erase DTC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC löschen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tyhjennä DTC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Effacer les DTC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC törlése</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC wissen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Radera DTC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Стерти DTC</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ERASE_DTCS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>erase DTCs?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTCs löschen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>poistaa DTC-koodit?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>effacer les DTC?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>törli a DTC-ket?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC's wissen?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>radera DTC:er?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>стерти DTC?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ERROR_UPDATING_CAN_ID_CUTOFF</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error updating CAN ID cutoff</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler beim Aktualisieren des CAN-ID-Schwellenwerts</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe CAN-tunnuksen raja-arvon päivittämisessä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur lors de la mise à jour du seuil d'ID CAN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba a CAN ID küszöbérték frissítésekor</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout bij bijwerken van CAN-ID-drempelwaarde</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel vid uppdatering av CAN ID-gränsvärde</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка оновлення порогу CAN ID</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ERROR_UPDATING_INTERFACE_FAILED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Error: updating interface failed</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fehler: Aktualisierung der Schnittstelle fehlgeschlagen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virhe: liitännän päivitys epäonnistui</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur: échec de la mise à jour de l'interface</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hiba: az interfész frissítése sikertelen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout: interface bijwerken mislukt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fel: uppdatering av gränssnitt misslyckades</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка: не вдалося оновити інтерфейс</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EVENTS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Events</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ereignisse</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tapahtumat</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Événements</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Események</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gebeurtenissen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Händelser</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Події</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EXPORT_TXT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Export to .txt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Als .txt exportieren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vie .txt-tiedostoon</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Exporter en .txt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Exportálás .txt-be</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Exporteren naar .txt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Exportera till .txt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Експортувати в .txt</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EXTENDS_BATTERY_LIFE_BY_RESCALING_THE_SOC_WITHIN_THE_CONFIGURED_MINIMUM_AND_MAXIMUM_PERC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extends battery life by rescaling the SOC within the configured minimum and maximum percentage. Should SOC scaling be applied? (0 = No, 1 = Yes):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verlängert die Batterielebensdauer durch Umskalierung des SOC innerhalb der konfigurierten Mindest- und Höchstprozentsätze. SOC-Skalierung anwenden? (0 = Nein, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Pidentää akun käyttöikää skaalaamalla SOC:n asetetun minimi- ja maksimiprosenttiosuuden sisälle. Otetaanko SOC-skaalaus käyttöön? (0 = Ei, 1 = Kyllä):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Prolonge la durée de vie de la batterie en recalibrant le SOC entre les pourcentages minimum et maximum configurés. Appliquer la mise à l'échelle du SOC ? (0 = Non, 1 = Oui) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Meghosszabbítja az akkumulátor élettartamát azáltal, hogy a SOC-t a beállított minimum és maximum százalékon belülre skálázza. Alkalmazzon SOC-skálázást? (0 = Nem, 1 = Igen):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Verlengt de levensduur van de batterij door de SOC te herschalen binnen het geconfigureerde minimum- en maximumpercentage. Moet SOC-schaling worden toegepast? (0 = Nee, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Förlänger batterilivslängden genom att skala om SOC inom de konfigurerade minimi- och maximiprocentvärdena. Ska SOC-skalning tillämpas? (0 = Nej, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Подовжує термін служби батареї шляхом масштабування SOC у межах налаштованих мінімального та максимального відсотків. Застосувати масштабування SOC? (0 = Ні, 1 = Так):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_EXTREMELY_DANGEROUS_OPTION_EMERGENCY_CHARGE_ALLOWS_RECOVERY_FOR_A_SEVERELY_UNDERCHARGED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extremely dangerous option. Emergency charge allows recovery for a severely undercharged battery. Limit charge power to avoid cell rupture and possible fire. Start 30min recovery process? (0 = No, 1 = Yes):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extrem gefährliche Option. Notladung ermöglicht die Wiederherstellung einer stark unterladenen Batterie. Ladeleistung begrenzen, um Zellenruptur und möglichen Brand zu vermeiden. 30min-Wiederherstellungsprozess starten? (0 = Nein, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erittäin vaarallinen asetus. Hätälataus mahdollistaa syvästi alijännitteisen akun elvyttämisen. Rajoita lataustehoa kennojen repeämisen ja mahdollisen tulipalon estämiseksi. Aloitetaanko 30min elvytysprosessi? (0 = Ei, 1 = Kyllä):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Option extrêmement dangereuse. La charge d'urgence permet la récupération d'une batterie sévèrement sous-chargée. Limiter la puissance de charge pour éviter la rupture de cellule et un incendie possible. Démarrer le processus de récupération de 30min ? (0 = Non, 1 = Oui) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Rendkívül veszélyes opció. A vészhelyzeti töltés lehetővé teszi egy erősen lemerült akkumulátor helyreállítását. Korlátozza a töltési teljesítményt a cellaszakadás és az esetleges tűz elkerülése érdekében. Elindítja a 30min helyreállítási folyamatot? (0 = Nem, 1 = Igen):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Uiterst gevaarlijke optie. Noodlading maakt herstel mogelijk van een ernstig ondergeladen batterij. Beperk het laadvermogen om celbreuk en mogelijke brand te voorkomen. Start het 30min herstelproces? (0 = Nee, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Extremt farligt alternativ. Nödladdning möjliggör återhämtning för ett kraftigt urladdat batteri. Begränsa laddeffekten för att undvika cellbristning och eventuell brand. Starta 30min återhämtningsprocess? (0 = Nej, 1 = Ja):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Вкрай небезпечна опція. Аварійне заряджання дозволяє відновити глибоко розряджену батарею. Обмежте потужність заряджання, щоб уникнути розриву елементів і можливої пожежі. Розпочати 30min процес відновлення? (0 = Ні, 1 = Так):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FACTORY_RESET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Factory reset</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Werkseinstellungen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tehdasasetusten palautus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réinitialisation d'usine</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gyári visszaállítás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabrieksinstellingen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabriksåterställning</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скидання до заводських</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FACTORY_RESET_FAILED_PLEASE_TRY_AGAIN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Factory reset failed. Please try again.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Werksreset fehlgeschlagen. Bitte erneut versuchen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tehdasasetusten palautus epäonnistui. Yritä uudelleen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Échec de la réinitialisation usine. Veuillez réessayer.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A gyári visszaállítás sikertelen. Kérjük, próbálja újra.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabrieksinstellingen herstellen mislukt. Probeer het opnieuw.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabriksåterställning misslyckades. Försök igen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скидання до заводських налаштувань не вдалося. Будь ласка, спробуйте ще раз.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FACTORY_RESET_SUCCESSFUL_THE_DEVICE_WILL_NOW_RESTART</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Factory reset successful. The device will now restart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Werksreset erfolgreich. Das Gerät wird jetzt neu gestartet.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tehdasasetusten palautus onnistui. Laite käynnistyy nyt uudelleen.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Réinitialisation usine réussie. L'appareil va maintenant redémarrer.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A gyári visszaállítás sikeres. Az eszköz most újraindul.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabrieksinstellingen hersteld. Het apparaat wordt nu opnieuw gestart.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fabriksåterställning lyckades. Enheten startar om.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скидання до заводських налаштувань успішне. Пристрій зараз перезавантажиться.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FETCHING_DTC_DESCRIPTIONS_FROM_GITHUB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fetching DTC descriptions from GitHub...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC-Beschreibungen werden von GitHub abgerufen...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Haetaan DTC-kuvauksia GitHubista...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Récupération des descriptions DTC depuis GitHub...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC leírások lekérése a GitHubról...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>DTC-omschrijvingen ophalen van GitHub...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hämtar DTC-beskrivningar från GitHub...</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Отримання описів DTC з GitHub...</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FILE_READ_ERROR</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>File read error</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Dateilesefehler</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tiedoston lukuvirhe</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Erreur de lecture de fichier</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fájlolvasási hiba</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fout bij lezen van bestand</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Filläsningsfel</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Помилка читання файлу</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FILE_UPLOADED_SUCCESSFULLY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>File uploaded successfully!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Datei erfolgreich hochgeladen!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tiedosto ladattu onnistuneesti!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fichier téléversé avec succès !</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>A fájl sikeresen feltöltve!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bestand succesvol geüpload!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Filen laddades upp!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Файл успішно завантажено!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
