<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FORMAT_THE_LANGUAGE_STORAGE_ALL_INSTALLED_LANGUAGES_ARE_ERASED</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Format the language storage? All installed languages are erased.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sprachspeicher formatieren? Alle installierten Sprachen werden gelöscht.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Alustetaanko kielitallennus? Kaikki asennetut kielet poistetaan.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Formater le stockage des langues ? Toutes les langues installées seront effacées.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Formázza a nyelvi tárolót? Az összes telepített nyelv törlésre kerül.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Taalopslag formatteren? Alle geïnstalleerde talen worden gewist.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Formatera språklagringen? Alla installerade språk raderas.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Форматувати сховище мов? Усі встановлені мови буде видалено.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_FREE_HEAP</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Free heap:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Freier Heap:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vapaa kekomuisti:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Heap libre:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Szabad heap:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vrije heap:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ledigt heap-minne:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Вільний heap:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
