<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_HOW_MUCH_ENERGY_THE_BATTERY_CAN_STORE_ENTER_NEW_WH_VALUE_1_400000</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>How much energy the battery can store. Enter new Wh value (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gibt an, wie viel Energie die Batterie speichern kann. Neuen Wh-Wert eingeben (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Akun varastoitavissa oleva energiamäärä. Anna uusi Wh-arvo (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Quantité d'énergie que la batterie peut stocker. Saisir la nouvelle valeur en Wh (1-400000) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Mennyi energiát képes tárolni az akkumulátor. Adja meg az új Wh értéket (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoeveel energie de batterij kan opslaan. Voer nieuwe Wh-waarde in (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hur mycket energi batteriet kan lagra. Ange nytt Wh-värde (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Скільки енергії може зберігати батарея. Введіть нове значення Wh (1-400000):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_IDLE_STATUS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Idle status</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Leerlaufstatus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lepotilan tila</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>État d'inactivité</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tétlen állapot</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inactieve status</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vilolägesstatus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Статус очікування</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INSPECT_REASON</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inspect reason</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ursache prüfen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tarkastele syytä</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Examiner la raison</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vizsgálja meg az okot</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Reden inspecteren</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Granska orsak</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Переглянути причину</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
