<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVALID_VALUE_1_OR_0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invalid value. Please enter 1 or 0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ungültiger Wert. Bitte 1 oder 0 eingeben</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virheellinen arvo. Anna 1 tai 0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valeur invalide. Veuillez saisir 1 ou 0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Érvénytelen érték. Adjon meg 1-et vagy 0-t</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ongeldige waarde. Voer 1 of 0 in</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ogiltigt värde. Ange 1 eller 0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Неприпустиме значення. Введіть 1 або 0</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVALID_VALUE_BETWEEN</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>{0}=lower bound {1}=upper bound</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invalid value. Please enter a value between {0} and {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ungültiger Wert. Bitte einen Wert zwischen {0} und {1} eingeben.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virheellinen arvo. Anna arvo väliltä {0} ja {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valeur invalide. Veuillez saisir une valeur entre {0} et {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Érvénytelen érték. Adjon meg egy értéket {0} és {1} között.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ongeldige waarde. Voer een waarde in tussen {0} en {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ogiltigt värde. Ange ett värde mellan {0} och {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Неприпустиме значення. Введіть значення від {0} до {1}.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVALID_VALUE_PLEASE_ENTER_A_VALUE_BETWEEN_1_AND_300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invalid value. Please enter a value between 1 and 300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ungültiger Wert. Bitte einen Wert zwischen 1 und 300 eingeben.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Virheellinen arvo. Anna arvo väliltä 1 ja 300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Valeur invalide. Veuillez saisir une valeur entre 1 et 300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Érvénytelen érték. Kérjük, adjon meg egy értéket 1 és 300 között.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ongeldige waarde. Voer een waarde in tussen 1 en 300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ogiltigt värde. Ange ett värde mellan 1 och 300</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Недійсне значення. Будь ласка, введіть значення від 1 до 300</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVERTER_ALLOWS_CONTACTOR_CLOSING</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter allows contactor closing:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichter erlaubt Schützschließen:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri sallii kontaktorien sulkemisen:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur autorise la fermeture des contacteurs:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter engedélyezi a mágneskapcsolók zárását:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormer staat contactorsluiting toe:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktaren tillåter kontaktorstängning:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор дозволяє замикання контакторів:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVERTER_PROTOCOL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter protocol:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Wechselrichter-Protokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertterin protokolla:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Protocole onduleur:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter protokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Omvormerprotocol:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växelriktarprotokoll:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Протокол інвертора:</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVERTER_WILL_SEE_COMPLETELY_DISCHARGED_0PCT_SOC_WHEN_THIS_VALUE_IS_REACHED_ADVANCED_USE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter will see completely discharged (0pct)SOC when this value is reached. Advanced users can set to negative values. Enter new minimum SOC value that battery will discharge to (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der Wechselrichter sieht vollständig entladen (0pct)SOC wenn dieser Wert erreicht wird. Fortgeschrittene Benutzer können negative Werte einstellen. Neuen minimalen SOC-Wert eingeben, bis zu dem die Batterie entlädt (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri näkee täysin tyhjän (0pct)SOC:n, kun tämä arvo saavutetaan. Edistyneet käyttäjät voivat asettaa negatiivisia arvoja. Anna uusi vähimmäis-SOC-arvo, johon akku puretaan (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur verra un SOC complètement déchargé (0pct) lorsque cette valeur est atteinte. Les utilisateurs avancés peuvent définir des valeurs négatives. Saisir la nouvelle valeur SOC minimum jusqu'à laquelle la batterie se déchargera (-10.0to50.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter teljesen lemerültnek fogja látni az akkumulátort (0pct)SOC, amikor ezt az értéket eléri. Haladó felhasználók negatív értékeket is beállíthatnak. Adja meg az új minimális SOC értéket, ameddig az akkumulátor merül (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De omvormer ziet volledig ontladen (0pct)SOC wanneer deze waarde wordt bereikt. Gevorderde gebruikers kunnen negatieve waarden instellen. Voer nieuwe minimale SOC-waarde in waarnaar de batterij ontlaadt (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertern ser helt urladdat (0pct)SOC när detta värde nås. Avancerade användare kan ange negativa värden. Ange nytt minimalt SOC-värde som batteriet urladdas till (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор вважатиме батарею повністю розрядженою (0pct)SOC, коли це значення буде досягнуто. Досвідчені користувачі можуть встановлювати від'ємні значення. Введіть нове мінімальне значення SOC, до якого розряджатиметься батарея (-10.0to50.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_INVERTER_WILL_SEE_FULLY_CHARGED_100PCT_SOC_WHEN_THIS_VALUE_IS_REACHED_ENTER_NEW_MAXIMUM</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Inverter will see fully charged (100pct)SOC when this value is reached. Enter new maximum SOC value that battery will charge to (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Der Wechselrichter sieht vollständig geladen (100pct)SOC wenn dieser Wert erreicht wird. Neuen maximalen SOC-Wert eingeben, bis zu dem die Batterie lädt (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertteri näkee täyteen ladatun (100pct)SOC:n, kun tämä arvo saavutetaan. Anna uusi enimmäis-SOC-arvo, johon akku ladataan (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>L'onduleur verra un SOC pleinement chargé (100pct) lorsque cette valeur est atteinte. Saisir la nouvelle valeur SOC maximum jusqu'à laquelle la batterie se chargera (50.0-100.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Az inverter teljesen töltöttnek fogja látni az akkumulátort (100pct)SOC, amikor ezt az értéket eléri. Adja meg az új maximális SOC értéket, ameddig az akkumulátor töltődik (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>De omvormer ziet volledig geladen (100pct)SOC wanneer deze waarde wordt bereikt. Voer nieuwe maximale SOC-waarde in waarnaar de batterij oplaadt (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Invertern ser fulladdat (100pct)SOC när detta värde nås. Ange nytt maximalt SOC-värde som batteriet laddas till (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Інвертор вважатиме батарею повністю зарядженою (100pct)SOC, коли це значення буде досягнуто. Введіть нове максимальне значення SOC, до якого заряджатиметься батарея (50.0-100.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_ISOLATION_TEST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Isolation Test</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Isolationstest</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Eristystesti</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Test d'isolement</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Szigetelési teszt</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Isolatietest</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Isolationstest</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Тест ізоляції</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
