<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_SOME_INVERTERS_NEEDS_TO_BE_ARTIFICIALLY_LIMITED_ENTER_NEW_MAXIMUM_CHARGE_CURRENT_IN_A_0</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Some inverters needs to be artificially limited. Enter new maximum charge current in A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Manche Wechselrichter müssen künstlich begrenzt werden. Neuen maximalen Ladestrom in A eingeben (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jotkin invertterit on rajoitettava keinotekoisesti. Anna uusi enimmäislatausvirta A:ssa (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Certains onduleurs doivent être artificiellement limités. Saisir le nouveau courant de charge maximum en A (0-1000.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Egyes invertereket mesterségesen korlátozni kell. Adja meg az új maximális töltőáramot A-ben (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sommige omvormers moeten kunstmatig worden begrensd. Voer nieuwe maximale laadstroom in A in (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vissa inverters behöver begränsas artificiellt. Ange ny maximal laddström i A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Деякі інвертори потребують штучного обмеження. Введіть новий максимальний струм заряджання в A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_SOME_INVERTERS_NEEDS_TO_BE_ARTIFICIALLY_LIMITED_ENTER_NEW_MAXIMUM_DISCHARGE_CURRENT_IN_A</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Some inverters needs to be artificially limited. Enter new maximum discharge current in A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Manche Wechselrichter müssen künstlich begrenzt werden. Neuen maximalen Entladestrom in A eingeben (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jotkin invertterit on rajoitettava keinotekoisesti. Anna uusi enimmäispurkausvirta A:ssa (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Certains onduleurs doivent être artificiellement limités. Saisir le nouveau courant de décharge maximum en A (0-1000.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Egyes invertereket mesterségesen korlátozni kell. Adja meg az új maximális kisütési áramot A-ben (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sommige omvormers moeten kunstmatig worden begrensd. Voer nieuwe maximale ontlaadstroom in A in (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vissa inverters behöver begränsas artificiellt. Ange ny maximal urladdningsström i A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Деякі інвертори потребують штучного обмеження. Введіть новий максимальний струм розряджання в A (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_SOME_INVERTERS_NEEDS_TO_BE_ARTIFICIALLY_LIMITED_ENTER_NEW_VOLTAGE_SETPOINT_BATTTERY_SHOU</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Some inverters needs to be artificially limited. Enter new voltage setpoint batttery should charge to (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Manche Wechselrichter müssen künstlich begrenzt werden. Neuen Spannungs-Sollwert eingeben, bis zu dem die Batterie laden soll (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jotkin invertterit on rajoitettava keinotekoisesti. Anna uusi jännitteen asetuspiste, johon akku ladataan (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Certains onduleurs doivent être artificiellement limités. Saisir la nouvelle consigne de tension jusqu'à laquelle la batterie doit se charger (0-1000.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Egyes invertereket mesterségesen korlátozni kell. Adja meg az új feszültségszint-beállítást, ameddig az akkumulátor töltődjön (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sommige omvormers moeten kunstmatig worden begrensd. Voer nieuw spanningsinstellingspunt in waarnaar de batterij moet laden (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vissa inverters behöver begränsas artificiellt. Ange nytt spänningsvärde som batteriet ska laddas till (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Деякі інвертори потребують штучного обмеження. Введіть нову уставку напруги, до якої батарея повинна заряджатися (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_SOME_INVERTERS_NEEDS_TO_BE_ARTIFICIALLY_LIMITED_ENTER_NEW_VOLTAGE_SETPOINT_BATTTERY_SHOU_2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Some inverters needs to be artificially limited. Enter new voltage setpoint batttery should discharge to (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Manche Wechselrichter müssen künstlich begrenzt werden. Neuen Spannungs-Sollwert eingeben, bis zu dem die Batterie entladen soll (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Jotkin invertterit on rajoitettava keinotekoisesti. Anna uusi jännitteen asetuspiste, johon akku puretaan (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Certains onduleurs doivent être artificiellement limités. Saisir la nouvelle consigne de tension jusqu'à laquelle la batterie doit se décharger (0-1000.0) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Egyes invertereket mesterségesen korlátozni kell. Adja meg az új feszültségszint-beállítást, ameddig az akkumulátor lemerüljön (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sommige omvormers moeten kunstmatig worden begrensd. Voer nieuw spanningsinstellingspunt in waarnaar de batterij moet ontladen (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vissa inverters behöver begränsas artificiellt. Ange nytt spänningsvärde som batteriet ska urladdas till (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Деякі інвертори потребують штучного обмеження. Введіть нову уставку напруги, до якої батарея повинна розряджатися (0-1000.0):</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_SSID</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SSID: </text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
