<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_THIS_ACTION_WILL_ATTEMPT_TO_CLOSE_CONTACTORS_AND_ENABLE_POWER_TRANSFER_ARE_YOU_SURE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>This action will attempt to close contactors and enable power transfer. Are you sure?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Diese Aktion versucht, die Schütze zu schließen und den Leistungsfluss zu aktivieren. Wirklich fortfahren?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tämä toiminto yrittää sulkea kontaktorit ja ottaa tehonsiirron käyttöön. Oletko varma?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cette action tentera de fermer les contacteurs et d'activer le transfert de puissance. Êtes-vous sûr ?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ez a művelet megkísérli bezárni a kontaktorokat és engedélyezni az energiaátvitelt. Biztosan folytatja?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Deze actie zal proberen de contactors te sluiten en energieoverdracht in te schakelen. Weet u het zeker?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Denna åtgärd försöker stänga kontaktorerna och aktivera effektöverföring. Är du säker?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ця дія спробує замкнути контактори та увімкнути передачу потужності. Ви впевнені?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_TOGGLE_SOC_METHOD</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Toggle SOC method</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-Methode umschalten</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vaihda SOC-menetelmää</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Basculer la méthode SOC</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-módszer váltása</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-methode wisselen</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Växla SOC-metod</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Перемкнути метод SOC</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_TOGGLE_SOC_METHOD_WILL_TOGGLE_BETWEEN_ESTIMATED_MEASURED_SOC_METHODS</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>toggle SOC method? This will toggle between ESTIMATED and MEASURED SOC methods.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>die SOC-Methode umschalten? Dies wechselt zwischen den SOC-Methoden GESCHÄTZT und GEMESSEN.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>vaihtaa SOC-menetelmää? Tämä vaihtaa ARVIOIDUN ja MITATUN SOC-menetelmän välillä.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>basculer la méthode SOC? Cela alternera entre les méthodes SOC ESTIMÉE et MESURÉE.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>váltja a SOC-módszert? Ez a BECSÜLT és a MÉRT SOC-módszer között vált.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>SOC-methode wisselen? Dit wisselt tussen de SOC-methodes GESCHAT en GEMETEN.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>växla SOC-metod? Detta växlar mellan ESTIMERAD och UPPMÄTT SOC-metod.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>перемкнути метод SOC? Це перемикає між ОЦІНЕНИМ та ВИМІРЯНИМ методами SOC.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_TOTAL_CAPACITY</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Total capacity</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Gesamtkapazität</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Kokonaiskapasiteetti</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Capacité totale</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Teljes kapacitás</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Totale capaciteit</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Total kapacitet</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Загальна ємність</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
<table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>UI_TRIGGER_NVROL_RESET_BATTERY_WILL_UNAVAILABLE_30_SECONDS_WHILE_ACTIVE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>trigger an NVROL reset? Battery will be unavailable for 30 seconds while this is active!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>einen NVROL-Reset auslösen? Die Batterie ist 30 Sekunden lang nicht verfügbar, während dies aktiv ist!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>käynnistää NVROL-nollauksen? Akku ei ole käytettävissä 30 sekuntiin tämän aikana!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>déclencher une réinitialisation NVROL? La batterie sera indisponible pendant 30 secondes pendant l'opération!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>elindít egy NVROL-visszaállítást? Az akkumulátor 30 másodpercig nem lesz elérhető, amíg ez aktív!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>een NVROL-reset activeren? Batterij is 30 seconden niet beschikbaar terwijl dit actief is!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>utlösa en NVROL-återställning? Batteriet är otillgängligt i 30 sekunder medan detta pågår!</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>запустити скидання NVROL? Батарея буде недоступна 30 секунд під час цієї операції!</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
